evidence/agent-teams/scheduler-wakeup-fix/2026-09-10T10-16-23Z/captain-session-f333e946.jsonl:413:{"type":"assistant/chunk","seq":9699,"time":1789026768286,"data":{"turn":1,"step":6,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":2,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_AMhn4juTNWaBJrWrguVE0956","name":"subagent","arguments":"{\"description\": \"Adversarial requirements questions\", \"prompt\": \"You are a Plan Reviewer running an adversarial REQUIREMENTS INTERROGATION for a small feature in the repo /root/dshProj/my-power-dsh. Read files as needed (read-only; do not edit anything).\\n\\nUSER REQUEST (Chinese, verbatim): \\\"遍历工程，了解工程详细信息，并对当前workmate系统做优化：1.可以给workmate改名 2.可以删除workmate\\\" — allow RENAMING a workmate and DELETING a workmate.\\n\\nDo NOT propose an implementation plan. Your deliverable is:\\n(1) At most 8 SHARP, DECISION-FORCING questions that only the USER (a human) can decide — semantics/product questions, each with why it matters and the candidate answers.\\n(2) A list of edge cases the implementation MUST handle.\\n(3) 2–4 INVARIANTS that acceptance criteria must pin.\\n\\nGROUNDED CONTEXT (measured — treat as fact, do not re-verify):\\n- packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/src/index.ts is the whole feature (~439 lines). Library root $HOME/.mpd/workmate, one dir per workmate: meta.json (name/baseId/baseName/description/provider/model/readonly/createdAt/updatedAt/uses/lastTask), persona.md (8KiB cap), memory.md (8KiB cap, oldest \\\"## \\\" blocks evicted), note.md (1536B cap); plus root-level index.json { name -> {name,baseId,baseName,uses,updatedAt} }. sanitizeName() lowercases and kebab-cases; init refuses an existing dir.\\n- Tools: mpd_workmate_list / _init / _spawn / _reflect / _match; cordis service `mpdWorkmate` = {list,get,read}.\\n- Web routes (exact): GET /plugins/mpd-workmate/list, GET /plugins/mpd-workmate/roster, GET /plugins/mpd-workmate/get?name=, POST /plugins/mpd-workmate/init. GUI = a DSH-better-sidebar tab from packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/src/web-client.js (SIDEBAR_TAB_ID=\\\"mpd-workmate\\\", sidebar-only, no floating fallback), zh+en locale dictionaries (zh is key-set source of truth), built into packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/client.js by `node scripts/build-mpd-client.mjs`.\\n- CROSS-MODULE BINDING: packages/mpd-agent-teams-plugin/lib/members.js#workmateKey(memberName) sanitizes a TEAM MEMBER NAME, and if $HOME/.mpd/workmate/<key> exists it injects that workmate's persona+memory+note into the member and tells it to call mpd_workmate_reflect after each task. A member is bound to a workmate by name equality alone — so renaming/deleting silently changes team-member backing.\\n- Tests: packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/test/workmate.test.ts (bun test, sandbox HOME). Gates: bun test, bun run typecheck, bun run test:qa, node scripts/verify-vendor.mjs, `dsh --profile headless --dump-config` in an isolated DSH_HOME. Evidence on disk under evidence/<domain>/<slug>/<timestamp>/. Docs are BILINGUAL (packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/README.md AND README.zh-CN.md); AGENTS.md is the binding English-only agent manual with workmate tools list, a glossary \\\"workmate\\\" entry and troubleshooting rows.\\n- Known defect discovered during traversal: the read-only tool deny lists (mpd-roles-plugin and mpd-workmate-plugin READONLY_DENY) name tools that this harness does NOT have (\\\"str_replace_editor\\\", \\\"apply_patch\\\"), and the harness rejects the whole restriction call — so read-only specialist spawn (mpd_role_spawn) and readonly workmate spawn currently FAIL. Judge whether that belongs in this change's scope.\\n\\nBe concrete and terse (bullets). Output exactly the three sections (1) USER QUESTIONS (2) EDGE CASES (3) INVARIANTS. No code, no plan.\"}"}}}}
