evidence/agent-teams/scheduler-wakeup-fix/2026-09-10T10-16-23Z/captain-session-f333e946.jsonl:1725:{"type":"assistant/chunk","seq":45203,"time":1789027172286,"data":{"turn":1,"step":21,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_LNfOaRZrlU34b88zJBKE7830","name":"agent_teams_create_task","arguments":"{\"acceptance\": [\"The T1 requirements contract and the T2 project-traversal dossier are persisted on disk under evidence/workmate/rename-delete-integration/<timestamp>/ (both were delivered as text by read-only roles), together with the verification result summary, so the reasoning survives the session.\", \"A code↔docs consistency pass confirms that every tool name, argument, route, status code and refusal semantic documented in AGENTS.md, the README pairs and the user guide matches the shipped sources; any drift is corrected or reported as an explicit open finding.\", \"The final integrated tree passes the gate sweep with real output recorded: bun test packages, bun run typecheck, bun run test:qa, node scripts/verify-vendor.mjs.\", \"The delivery report states: the changed files, the user decisions implemented (archive-first delete; refused while in use plus a complete library-owned rename cascade; the read-only deny defect fixed; agent tools + Workmates GUI; ASCII-only naming), what is deliberately NOT rewritten (archived team records), the evidence paths, and any residual risk or follow-up.\", \"No required review (t7, t8, t9) is left with unresolved findings and no verification (t6) is left failed at integration time.\", \"The bundled artifact state is coherent: the touched package dists and the rebuilt web client match the sources, and the release/pack path is left in a re-packable state.\"], \"assignee\": \"Lead\", \"dependencies\": [\"t2\", \"t6\", \"t7\", \"t8\", \"t9\", \"t11\"], \"description\": \"Integrate the verified, reviewed work into one coherent change on disk and report it honestly. You own the last mile: nothing may be described as done that the evidence does not support.\\n\\nDo this concretely:\\n1. Persist the read-only deliverables that only exist as task text (the t1 contract, the t2 dossier) into the evidence tree for this change, together with a summary of t6's verification results.\\n2. Re-run the gate sweep on the FINAL integrated tree (after t11's doc/QA-script sync) and record the real output — an earlier green run on a pre-sync tree does not count.\\n3. Check code↔docs consistency in both directions and fix drift inside your inScope (documentation paths) only; report any code-side drift as an open finding instead of editing implementation files.\\n4. Produce the delivery report as your task output: changed files, the decisions implemented, the explicit non-goals and non-rewrites (archived team records are historical and untouched), evidence paths, residual risk, and anything the user should decide next (for example whether Unicode/CJK workmate names should be supported in a follow-up).\\n5. Confirm the release path is coherent: rebuilt package dists and the rebuilt web client correspond to the sources, so a later `npm run pack` would ship what was verified.\\n\\nIf a required review or verification is still failing, do not paper over it: report the integration as failed with the concrete blocker.\", \"inScope\": [\"evidence/workmate/rename-delete-integration/\", \"AGENTS.md\", \"docs/\", \"README.md\", \"README.zh-CN.md\", \"packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/README.md\", \"packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/README.zh-CN.md\"], \"nonGoals\": [\"Changing implementation code to make a gate pass\", \"Restarting or redoing a review that already returned pass\", \"Re-litigating the user's decisions\"], \"objective\": \"Integrate the verified and reviewed rename/delete feature, the read-only deny fix and the documentation sync into one coherent, gate-clean change: persist the read-only deliverables as on-disk evidence, re-run the full gate sweep on the final tree, reconcile documentation against the shipped code, and report what changed, what was proven, what was deliberately not done, and what remains open.\", \"outOfScope\": [\"packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/src/\", \"packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/src/\", \"packages/mpd-roles-plugin/src/\", \"skills/dsh-qa/scripts/\"], \"round\": 1, \"subject\": \"Integrate and report: rename/delete + read-only fix + docs as one coherent change\", \"verify\": [\"bun test packages\", \"bun run typecheck\", \"bun run test:qa\", \"node scripts/verify-vendor.mjs\"]}"}}}}
