t\": \"Goal: 遍历工程 + 优化 workmate 系统 — (1) rename a workmate, (2) delete a workmate.\\n\\nFive user decisions (binding):\\nD1 Delete = archive-first: default move to ~/.mpd/workmate/.archive/<name>-<ISO>/ (hidden from list/match, restorable); real removal only via explicit purge; GUI gets a confirmation step.\\nD2 In-use gate + full cascade: refuse rename/delete while the workmate is in use (in-flight spawn in this process; a member bound by name in a live/non-archived team). Once allowed, update ALL library-owned name references (dir key, meta.name, index.json key, note.md self-reference, continuity metadata). Archived team records are historical — never rewritten.\\nD3 The read-only deny-list defect is IN scope: READONLY_DENY (mpd-roles-plugin/src/index.ts ~L23-27 and mpd-workmate-plugin/src/index.ts L30) names tools this harness does not register (str_replace_editor, apply_patch) and the harness rejects the WHOLE tools.restrict() call, so every read-only spawn (mpd_role_spawn, readonly workmate) fails. Existing tests only asserted the constructed array against a stub.\\nD4 Surface = agent tools + web routes + Workmates sidebar GUI (zh/en).\\nD5 ASCII-only key scheme now: names limited to [a-z0-9_-]; invalid/empty-sanitized names rejected BEFORE any fs call. Hazard: sanitizeName(\\\"\\\") === \\\"\\\" and wmDir(\\\"\\\") IS the library root.\\n\\nKey facts measured: workmate binding is name-equality only (packages/mpd-agent-teams-plugin/lib/members.js#workmateKey vs mpd-workmate's sanitizeName — must stay byte-identical); no cordis service exists for agent-teams state (only agent_teams_* tools); index.json has no reader today; the Workmates tab is DSH-better-sidebar-only (no floating fallback) with zh as locale key-set source of truth and a required `node scripts/build-mpd-client.mjs` rebuild.\\n\\nTeam: staged \\\"MPD Default\\\" (profile mpd, 11 members, captain planning) with DAG t1..t12: requirements (Planner) -> core impl (Senior Engineer) + GUI impl (Junior Engineer) parallel, read-only fix (Deep Worker) -> verification (Reviewer) + 3 reviews (Architect/Plan Reviewer/Senior Engineer) -> bilingual docs+QA sync (Lead) -> integration (Lead).\"}"}],"source":{"kind":"model","provider":"deepseek-official","model":"deepseek-v4-flash"},"id":"12baf95f-7f6c-4f89-818a-f583c3186707"},"usage":{"inputTokens":166,"outputTokens":964,"totalTokens":119914,"cacheReadTokens":118784,"reasoningTokens":245}},"sourceEventSeqs":[[45211,46106]],"surfaceOp":"append"}
evidence/agent-teams/scheduler-wakeup-fix/2026-09-10T10-16-23Z/captain-session-f333e946.jsonl:1773:{"type":"tool/result","seq":46109,"time":1789027178668,"data":{"turn":1,"step":22,"message":{"source":{"kind":"tool","callId":"call_00_HSkuVbFetCuOHifv8AU25531"},"content":[{"type":"tool-result","toolCallId":"call_00_HSkuVbFetCuOHifv8AU25531","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Team \"MPD Default\" — Auto-provisioned default team for this session (session-start team policy; staged — the captain designs the roster/DAG, then the user reviews and approves the plan in the Web panel).\nProfile: mpd [captain] — Read-only members (Architect, Researcher, Planner, Explorer, Plan Reviewer, Vision Analyst) take requirements/review/analysis tasks only and never edit files. Workers (Senior Engineer, Junior Engineer, Deep Worker, Lead, Reviewer) take impl\nLoop: running — Work remains on the shared task list; wait for the scheduler or complete owned tasks.\nViewing as: captain\nMembers (11):\n  - Architect [architecture review / deep debugging / self-review] idle/unspawned · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\n  - Researcher [code / open-source evidence search] idle/unspawned · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning high\n  - Planner [planning / task decomposition] idle/unspawned · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\n  - Explorer [read-only codebase exploration] idle/unspawned · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning high\n  - Reviewer [correctness / risk review] idle/unspawned · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\n  - Plan Reviewer [work-plan QA review / UI-UX critique] idle/unspawned · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning high\n  - Vision Analyst [image / diagram analysis] idle/unspawned · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp · reasoning high\n  - Lead [orchestration / integration] idle/unspawned · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\n  - Deep Worker [autonomous goal-driven implementation] idle/unspawned · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning high\n  - Senior Engineer [primary implementation] idle/unspawned · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\n  - Junior Engineer [small mechanical changes] idle/unspawned · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning high\nTasks (11):\n  - t1 [pending] requirements r1 attempt 0 Requirements contract + pinned wire protocol for workmate rename/delete → Planner\n  - t2 [pending] work attempt 0 Project traversal dossier: the workmate system in full bundle context → Explorer\n  - t3 [pending] work r1 attempt 0 Implement workmate rename + delete core: tools, service, routes, safety, tests → Senior Engineer (deps: t1)\n  - t4 [pending] work r1 attempt 0 Workmates sidebar tab: rename + delete controls (zh/en) and rebuilt client → Junior Engineer (deps: t1)\n  - t5 [pending] work r1 attempt 0 Fix read-only deny lists so read-only spawn works on the real harness → Deep Worker\n  - t6 [pending] work r1 attempt 0 Independent verification: rename/delete end-to-end, negative cases, full gate sweep → Reviewer (deps: t3,t4,t5)\n  - t7 [pending] work r1 attempt 0 Review: core rename/delete implementation (safety, identity, atomicity, races) → Architect (deps: t3)\n  - t8 [pending] work r1 attempt 0 Review: Workmates tab rename/delete UI, zh/en strings, rebuilt client → Plan Reviewer (deps: t4)\n  - t9 [pending] work r1 attempt 0 Review: read-only deny-list fix and its real-harness proof → Senior Engineer (deps: t5)\n  - t11 [pending] work r1 attempt 0 Bilingual docs + QA assertion sync for workmate rename/delete → Lead (deps: t3,t4,t5,t6)\n  - t12 [pending] work r1 attempt 0 Integrate and report: rename/delete + read-only fix + docs as one coherent change → Lead (deps: t2,t6,t7,t8,t9,t11)\nCoverage:\n  - 1. 可以给workmate改名: in_progress (t1)\n  - 2. 可以删除workmate: in_progress (t1)\n  - 遍历工程，了解工程详细信息: in_progress (t1)\nDelivery: blocked (t1 (requirements) is not completed)\nCaptain inbox (0):"}],"isError":false}],"role":"user","id":"6ea8331b-f809-4a7e-bd08-7c6cd4e6fe2e"}},"sourceEventSeqs":[46108],"surfaceOp":"append"}
