neer).' No kind echo. So no info.\n\nLet me probe: remove t3, recreate with the same contract, then status. If it lands as \"implementation\", great: I'll rebuild t4-t12. If not, the display is mapping quality kinds to \"work\", and I'll verify differently (e.g. by checking whether a review task's completion demands a verdict — that only happens at runtime).\n\nLet me proceed with the probe."},{"type":"text","text":"The status shows `t1` as `requirements` but every other task degraded to `work` — if that is real, the quality gates (verdict=pass, review loop) would silently not apply. Let me probe it empirically."},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_kynXKRAUDZlVR1r8679z4497","name":"agent_teams_edit_plan","arguments":"{\"operations\": [{\"action\": \"remove_task\", \"task_id\": \"t3\"}]}"}],"source":{"kind":"model","provider":"deepseek-official","model":"deepseek-v4-flash"},"id":"a3016c4f-85a0-406e-8f0d-74438d93c20b"},"usage":{"inputTokens":1162,"outputTokens":1525,"totalTokens":122495,"cacheReadTokens":119808,"reasoningTokens":1417}},"sourceEventSeqs":[[46114,47611]],"surfaceOp":"append"}
