ementation] idle/unspawned · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning high\n  - Senior Engineer [primary implementation] idle/unspawned · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\n  - Junior Engineer [small mechanical changes] idle/unspawned · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning high\nTasks (11):\n  - t1 [pending] requirements r1 attempt 0 Requirements contract + pinned wire protocol for workmate rename/delete → Planner\n  - t2 [pending] work attempt 0 Project traversal dossier: the workmate system in full bundle context → Explorer\n  - t15 [pending] implementation r1 attempt 0 Implement workmate rename + delete core: tools, service, routes, safety, tests → Senior Engineer (deps: t1)\n  - t16 [pending] implementation r1 attempt 0 Workmates sidebar tab: rename + delete controls (zh/en) and rebuilt client → Junior Engineer (deps: t1)\n  - t17 [pending] implementation r1 attempt 0 Fix read-only deny lists so read-only spawn works on the real harness → Deep Worker (deps: t1)\n  - t18 [pending] verification r1 attempt 0 Independent verification: rename/delete end-to-end, negative cases, full gate sweep → Reviewer (deps: t15,t16,t17)\n  - t19 [pending] review r1 attempt 0 Review: core rename/delete implementation (safety, identity, atomicity, races) → Architect (deps: t15)\n  - t20 [pending] review r1 attempt 0 Review: Workmates tab rename/delete UI, zh/en strings, rebuilt client → Plan Reviewer (deps: t16)\n  - t21 [pending] review r1 attempt 0 Review: read-only deny-list fix and its real-harness proof → Senior Engineer (deps: t17)\n  - t22 [pending] implementation r1 attempt 0 Bilingual docs + QA assertion sync for workmate rename/delete → Lead (deps: t1,t15,t16,t17,t18)\n  - t23 [pending] integration r1 attempt 0 Integrate and report: rename/delete + read-only fix + docs as one coherent change → Lead (deps: t1,t2,t18,t19,t20,t21,t22)\nCoverage:\n  - 1. 可以给workmate改名: in_progress (t1)\n  - 2. 可以删除workmate: in_progress (t1)\n  - 遍历工程，了解工程详细信息: in_progress (t1)\nDelivery: blocked (t1 (requirements) is not completed; t15 (implementation) is not completed; t16 (implementation) is not completed; t17 (implementation) is not completed; t18 (verification) is not completed; t19 (review) is not completed; t20 (review) is not completed; t21 (review) is not completed; t22 (implementation) is not completed; t23 (integration) is not completed)\nCaptain inbox (0):"}],"isError":false}],"role":"user","id":"0b63bae2-5c76-4bcc-95ab-8ce32e5581ac"}},"sourceEventSeqs":[62376],"surfaceOp":"append"}
