evidence/agent-teams/scheduler-wakeup-fix/2026-09-10T10-16-23Z/captain-session-f333e946.jsonl:2483:{"type":"assistant/chunk","seq":64195,"time":1789027290861,"data":{"turn":1,"step":40,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"reasoning","text":"The plan is now correct:\n- t1 requirements (Planner)\n- t2 work (Explorer)\n- t15 implementation (Senior Engineer)\n- t16 implementation (Junior Engineer)\n- t17 implementation (Deep Worker)\n- t18 verification (Reviewer)\n- t19 review (Architect)\n- t20 review (Plan Reviewer)\n- t21 review (Senior Engineer)\n- t22 implementation (Lead)\n- t23 integration (Lead)\n\nAll kinds preserved with assignees. 11 tasks, 11 members; unused: Researcher, Vision Analyst.\n\nNow I should end the turn and tell the user the Web plan is ready, summarizing:\n1. What I found in the traversal (the key facts + the defect).\n2. The agreed requirements (their 5 answers).\n3. The plan structure.\n4. What to do: review/approve in the Web panel.\n\nI must NOT call agent_teams_approve.\n\nAlso mention: I did not call agent_teams_create because the session-start policy already provisioned the staged team \"MPD Default\" (profile mpd) and a second team is disallowed — so I designed the DAG on it.\n\nAlso mention the one open item for their decision at approval time: CJK naming deferred to a follow-up (per their choice) — and note the interpretation of \"agent在跑的时候不让改，改了以后全改\" as implemented: refuse while in use + full cascade of library-owned references, archived team records left as historical (they can correct this at review).\n\nLet me write it in Chinese (user's language), concise but complete. Mention file paths as inline code.\n\nFormat: a compact briefing with sections. Use markdown. Keep it reasonably tight — but the user asked to traverse the project and understand details, so a short \"what I learned\" section is valuable.\n\nI should mention the probe/rebuild? Not necessary — it's internal mechanics. Maybe one line: nothing. Skip. Actually transparency about plan mechanics isn't needed; but the note that the plan was rebuilt isn't user-relevant.\n\nLet me write the final message.\n\nDeliverable mention: no files created in this turn (reconnaissance only) + memory entry written. Mention the memory entry path? It's in the user's memory store — mention briefly: 已把需求决策写入 memory (`workmate-rename-delete-agreed-requirements-2026--mtv8l9rl.md`). Good.\n\nAlso the plan is \"blocked\" in delivery terms because nothing has run yet — that's the staged state, fine.\n\nLet me write it."}}}}
evidence/agent-teams/scheduler-wakeup-fix/2026-09-10T10-16-23Z/captain-session-f333e946.jsonl:2484:{"type":"assistant/chunk","seq":64196,"time":1789027290861,"data":{"turn":1,"step":40,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"工程遍历与需求确认已完成，**Web 计划已就绪，等你审核批准**（我不能自己 approve）。\n\n## 一、遍历结论（关键事实，均已核实到源码/行号）\n\n**workmate 系统的真实耦合面**（比 `mpd-workmate-plugin` 本身大得多）：\n\n| 面 | 事实 | 对改名/删除的影响 |\n|---|---|---|\n| 库结构 | `~/.mpd/workmate/<name>/` = `meta.json` + `persona.md`(8KiB) + `memory.md`(8KiB，溢出淘汰最老 `## ` 块) + `note.md`(1536B)，另有根级 `index.json` | `index.json` **目前没有任何读取方**，改名/删除必须自己维护，否则永久残留脏键 |\n| 绑定 | `packages/mpd-agent-teams-plugin/lib/members.js#workmateKey` 把**团队成员名** sanitize 后按目录存在性绑定 workmate | 判定标准只有\"名字相等\"；改名/删除会静默改变成员的 backing |\n| key 算法 | `sanitizeName()` 与 `workmateKey()` 必须**逐字节一致** | 任何键方案改动都要两边同步 |\n| 危险点 | `sanitizeName(\"助理\") === \"\"`，而 `wmDir(\"\")` **就是库根目录** | 未校验的空名会让删除/改名指向整个库 |\n| GUI | `packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/src/web-client.js`（`SIDEBAR_TAB_ID=\"mpd-workmate\"`，仅侧边栏、无浮窗兜底，zh 为文案 key 源，必须 rebuild `client.js`） | 改完不重建 = 界面什么都不变 |\n| 服务面 | agent-teams **没有**提供 cordis 服务，只有 `agent_teams_*` 工具 | 跨插件\"级联改名\"没有官方 API，不能直接写别人的状态 |\n\n**顺带发现一个真实缺陷（已复现）**：`mpd-roles-plugin` 与 `mpd-workmate-plugin` 的只读 deny 列表里写了本 harness 不存在的工具名（`str_replace_editor`、`apply_patch`），harness 会**整体拒绝** `tools.restrict()` 调用——所以现在 `mpd_role_spawn` 的只读角色、以及 readonly workmate 的 spawn **全部失败**。现有单测只断言了数组构造（stub），从未跑真 harness，所以一直没暴露。你已确认纳入本次范围。\n\n## 二、已与你敲定的需求（5 项决策）\n\n1. **删除 = 归档优先**：默认移到 `~/.mpd/workmate/.archive/<name>-<时间戳>/`（列表/match 隐藏、可恢复），只有显式 purge 才真删；GUI 二次确认。\n2. **使用中禁止改动 + 改了全改**：有 agent 正在用它（本进程内有进行中的 spawn、或活跃/未归档团队里有同名成员）时**拒绝**改名/删除；一旦允许，workmate 自身名下所有引用全部更新（目录名、`meta.name`、`index.json` 键、`note.md` 自指、继承 `renamedFrom`）。**已归档团队记录视为历史，不改写**——这点写在计划里，如与你本意不符请在审核时指出。\n3. readonly deny 缺陷纳入本次修复 + 真 harness 回归。\n4. 交互面 = agent 工具 + Web 路由 + Workmates 侧边栏 GUI（zh/en 双语）。\n5. 暂保持 ASCII 命名；非法/中文/空名在**任何文件系统调用之前**拒绝（中文名支持列为后续可选项）。\n\n## 三、团队计划（`MPD Default`，profile `mpd`，11 成员）\n\n```\nt1  需求契约 + 精确 wire protocol ── Planner（只读，verdict 门）\nt2  工程遍历档案（耦合图/失效面）── Explorer（只读）\n│\n├─ t15 核心：工具/服务/路由/安全门/级联 ── Senior Engineer  ┐\n├─ t16 GUI：改名+删除控件 + client 重建 ── Junior Engineer  ├ 三者并行\n└─ t17 只读 deny 修复 + 真 harness 回归 ── Deep Worker      ┘\n        │\n        ├─ t18 独立验证（全 gate + sandbox HOME 正/负用例）── Reviewer\n        ├─ t19 审查 t15（安全/身份保持/原子性/竞态）── Architect\n        ├─ t20 审查 t16（wire 一致性 + zh/en + UX/破坏性流程）── Plan Reviewer\n        └─ t21 审查 t17（真 harness 证据强度 + 只读权限未被放宽）── Senior Engineer\n                │\n                t22 中英双语文档 + QA 断言同步 ── Lead\n                t23 集成与交付报告（落盘证据 + 终局 gate 扫描）── Lead\n```\n\n要点：三个实现任务**并行**（t1 先把 wire contract 钉死），验证与 3 个审查并行，文档在验证后（描述已验证行为而非意图），集成放最后。每个任务都带 objective/acceptance/inScope/verify 契约；只读成员（Planner/Explorer/Architect/Plan Reviewer）只出结论不写文件。\n\n本次需求决策已写入 memory：`workmate-rename-delete-agreed-requirements-2026--mtv8l9rl.md`。\n\n👉 请到 Web 计划面板审核；可直接 **Approve & Run**，或回聊天里提出要改的地方（例如\"归档记录也要一起改\"或\"要支持中文名\"），我会用一次原子编辑修订计划后再请你确认。"}}}}
