`test/sidebar-tab.test.mjs`, `test/client-harness.mjs`, `src/team-page.js`, `scripts/build-mpd-client.mjs`. Because my step rebuilds `client.js` from on-disk sources, the baseline should be pinned (committed or explicitly blessed) before t15/t16 regenerate artifacts, or downstream review/verification cannot diff against a known state.\n\nNext: idle and waiting for the scheduler to unlock t16 after t1 completes (or for captain guidance). I sent the captain the same readiness note via agent_teams_send_message."}],"source":{"kind":"agent-message","form":"relay","senderSessionId":"7109eec1-fa75-4fec-8bb0-37de2ef82a82"},"role":"user","id":"51d23fc2-a4cd-4acb-be73-bdd5efc09617"}]}}
