ry: blocked (t1 (requirements) is not completed; t15 (implementation) is not completed; t16 (implementation) is not completed; t17 (implementation) is not completed; t18 (verification) is not completed; t19 (review) is not completed; t20 (review) is not completed; t21 (review) is not completed; t22 (implementation) is not completed; t23 (integration) is not completed)\nCaptain inbox (0):"}],"isError":false}],"role":"user","id":"2f41008d-013f-47b3-ba3d-bb68e12d8fdc"}},"sourceEventSeqs":[69744],"surfaceOp":"append"}
evidence/agent-teams/scheduler-wakeup-fix/2026-09-10T10-16-23Z/captain-session-f333e946.jsonl:2781:{"type":"user/message","seq":69749,"time":1789027379156,"data":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"AgentTeams message from member Junior Engineer:\n\nJunior Engineer readiness note (no work started — t16 is mine but blocked on t1, and I will not claim a non-ready task).\n\nBASELINE HAZARD (affects t16/t18/t19/t20/t23): the working tree is DIRTY against HEAD f697088 (merge \"workmate library as a DSH-better-sidebar tab\", committed 2026-09-10 01:22 UTC) with ~6h-old post-commit edits that were never committed, and they sit exactly on my target files:\n- packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/src/web-client.js (+301/-… working-tree diff)\n- packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/client.js (899-line diff, mtime 07:36 UTC)\n- packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/test/{sidebar-tab.test.mjs, client-harness.mjs}, src/team-page.js, scripts/build-mpd-client.mjs\nConsequence: my t16 step \"node scripts/build-mpd-client.mjs\" regenerates client.js FROM the current on-disk sources, so whatever in-flight state exists is frozen into the artifact, and verification/review cannot diff against a known baseline. Recommend the plan pin the baseline (commit or explicitly bless the dirty tree) before t15/t16 rebuild artifacts — otherwise t18/t20 evidence is not reproducible.\n\nMY EDIT SURFACE FOR t16 (confirmed by reading the code, nothing written):\n- UI + i18n: packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/src/web-client.js — WORKMATE locale namespace ~L137-180 (\"zh is the key-set source of truth\"), route consts LIST/INIT/ROSTER/GET ~L123-126 (/plugins/mpd-workmate/*), rows/detail ~L235-330, tab registered via sidebar.registerTab (SIDEBAR_TAB_ID=\"mpd-workmate\").\n- Rebuild: node scripts/build-mpd-client.mjs (must contain the rebuilt marker strings), then packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/test/sidebar-tab.test.mjs (describe \"workmate page\" pins list+roster fetches) and test/client-harness.mjs fixtures.\n- Wire contract for rename/delete comes