evidence/agent-teams/scheduler-wakeup-fix/2026-09-10T10-16-23Z/captain-session-f333e946.jsonl:3188:{"type":"assistant/chunk","seq":80475,"time":1789027449080,"data":{"turn":2,"step":8,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"reasoning","text":"Now write the final summary to the user. Keep it focused:\n\n1. Team is running (approved) — t1/t2 in progress.\n2. What I did in response to the standby wave: answered the Junior Engineer's baseline question (verified myself), sent guidance to Reviewer and Lead.\n3. Corrected a teammate's mistaken claim (client.js not stale).\n4. Decisions on the two idle members asking for work: Vision Analyst — no (browser tooling absent, verified); Researcher — no (would duplicate t2/t19 or arrive too late).\n5. Note: plan text can no longer be edited (team running) — so those two members stay unassigned; if the user wants them used, there are options (e.g. add a member task? Actually tasks can still be created via agent_teams_create_task in a running team! The tool description says: \"Create a task in your team's task list\" — and the protocol mentions creating tasks in a running team (\"create_task no longer silently resumes a halted team\"). So if the user wants a research lane, I could add it. I'll offer that.)\n6. Next: monitor; writers start when t1 lands.\n\nKeep it concise — the user is the reviewer. Include the key numbers: 11 tasks, t1/t2 running, 9 members idle.\n\nLet me write in Chinese."}}}}
evidence/agent-teams/scheduler-wakeup-fix/2026-09-10T10-16-23Z/captain-session-f333e946.jsonl:3192:{"type":"assistant/message","seq":80479,"time":1789027449083,"data":{"turn":2,"step":8,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"Now write the final summary to the user. Keep it focused:\n\n1. Team is running (approved) — t1/t2 in progress.\n2. What I did in response to the standby wave: answered the Junior Engineer's baseline question (verified myself), sent guidance to Reviewer and Lead.\n3. Corrected a teammate's mistaken claim (client.js not stale).\n4. Decisions on the two idle members asking for work: Vision Analyst — no (browser tooling absent, verified); Researcher — no (would duplicate t2/t19 or arrive too late).\n5. Note: plan text can no longer be edited (team running) — so those two members stay unassigned; if the user wants them used, there are options (e.g. add a member task? Actually tasks can still be created via agent_teams_create_task in a running team! The tool description says: \"Create a task in your team's task list\" — and the protocol mentions creating tasks in a running team (\"create_task no longer silently resumes a halted team\"). So if the user wants a research lane, I could add it. I'll offer that.)\n6. Next: monitor; writers start when t1 lands.\n\nKeep it concise — the user is the reviewer. Include the key numbers: 11 tasks, t1/t2 running, 9 members idle.\n\nLet me write in Chinese."},{"type":"text","text":"已处理完这一轮成员报到，向你汇报当前态势与我的判断。\n\n## 现状：团队已进入 running（计划已批准）\n\n`t1`（需求契约，Planner）与 `t2`（工程遍历档案，Explorer）已在执行（attempt 1），其余 9 个任务仍 pending——其余 9 名成员**都正确地没有抢占被依赖阻塞的任务**，这符合规则。注意：我本人没有调用过 approve，所以计划文本现在已锁定（`agent_teams_edit_plan` 返回 \"already running\"）。如果你并没有在面板点批准，请说一声。\n\n## 成员报到暴露的一个真问题（我亲自复核了）\n\nJunior Engineer 提出一个值得认真对待的**基线风险**，我独立核实后结论是\"一半对、一半错\"：\n\n- ✅ **工作区确实是脏的**：HEAD `f697088` + **33 个未提交条目**（上一个会话的 sidebar 迁移工作：AGENTS.md、README 双语、docs/*、VENDOR_LOCK.json、`packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/{client.js,src/web-client.js,test/*}`、scripts/*、skills/dsh-qa/* 以及未跟踪的 evidence/ 与两个新测试文件）。\n- ❌ 但它说的 \"client.js 899 行 diff、会被冻结不干净的状态\" **是误读**：`client.js`（15:36）比源文件 `src/web-client.js`（15:27）**更新**，且已包含当前标记（`SIDEBAR_TAB_ID = \"mpd-workmate\"`、`registerWorkmateSidebarTab`），所以不是陈旧产物，那个 diff 只是\"相对 HEAD 的未提交差异\"，不是待重建。\n\n由于计划已锁定，我改用**指导消息**把基线决定下达给真正受影响的三个成员（t15/t17 的目标包都不在脏文件里，无需打扰）：\n- **Junior Engineer**（t16 重建共享产物）：脏树是基线、不许 commit/stash/revert/整理，证据须记录前后 `git status --porcelain`，自己的 delta 与既有改动分开报；并纠正了它的 client.js 判断。\n- **Reviewer**（t18 验证证据）：同样基线约束，明确禁止\"为了让测试看起来干净而清理既有改动\"。\n- **Lead**（t22/t23）：除基线外，特别交办\"t1 契约与 t2 档案只存在于任务文本里（只读成员不能写文件），必须由它落盘到 evidence 树\"，并明确**不要**在文档里宣称做过浏览器渲染级视觉验证。\n\n## 两位请战的成员：我决定不加任务\n\n- **Vision Analyst**（申请做 Workmates 页签的视觉验证）：**不行**。我已实测这个沙箱没有可用浏览器驱动——`~/.cache/ms-playwright/` 下没有 chrome 二进制，全局/仓库/node_modules 里也没有 playwright 包（只有空壳缓存目录）。加了这个任务只会产生必然失败的门禁和修复循环。GUI 只能到源码/测试/路由级验证，这一点已写进给 Lead 的指导。\n- **Researcher**（提出 3 条研究线）：**本次不用**。第 2 条与 t2 重复、第 3 条与 t19 重复；第 1 条（外部先例：tombstone/引用完整性）虽然有价值，但 t1 已经在跑、t15 紧接着开跑，等它回来契约已定稿，属于\"产出无人消费\"的并行研究。把外部先例当作后续可选增强更合适——如果你想现在就要，我可以单独给它建一个任务（running 状态下仍可新建任务）。\n\n## 接下来\n\n我继续以队长身份监控：`t1` 完成后调度器会自动释放 `t15/t16/t17`（三个实现可并行，因为 wire contract 已在 t1 里钉死），随后 `t18` 验证与 `t19–t21` 三个审查并行，最后由 `t22/t23` 收口。我会在每次进展通知后检查，并在最终交付时**自己复核成员声称的结果**（含 t1 契约是否真的落盘、client.js 是否与源一致）再向你汇报。"}],"source":{"kind":"model","provider":"deepseek-official","model":"deepseek-v4-flash"},"id":"f9212892-0699-4359-91ff-06d248d6bc28"},"usage":{"inputTokens":253,"outputTokens":1210,"totalTokens":172343,"cacheReadTokens":170880,"reasoningTokens":282}},"sourceEventSeqs":[[79265,80478]],"surfaceOp":"append"}
evidence/agent-teams/scheduler-wakeup-fix/2026-09-10T10-16-23Z/captain-session-f333e946.jsonl:3195:{"type":"agent/inbox/spliced","seq":80482,"time":1789027718828,"data":{"target":"next-step","start":0,"inserted":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"AgentTeams message from member Planner:\n\nt1 COMPLETE (requirements, verdict=pass). Full binding contract is in the t1 task output; read it there — it is long and t15/t16/t17/t18 must build against it verbatim.\n\nTOP FINDINGS the DAG must absorb:\n\n1) READ-ONLY DEFECT ROOT CAUSE (affects t15 AND t17 — escalate priority). `READONLY_DENY` contains `apply_patch`, which is registered NOWHERE in this dsh install. The harness `ToolRuntime.restrict()` (dsh-tools/lib/index.js:2803) THROWS `names unknown global tool \"apply_patch\"` for any unregistered name, and it runs in `applyChildComposition` (dsh-subagent/lib/index.js:711) BEFORE the child starts. So EVERY read-only spawn fails today: all 6 read-only roster roles AND every readonly workmate. The defect is a single dead name, not a design flaw.\n   - `str_replace_editor` is VALID (host row dsh-base/cordis.patch.yml:424 → global layer). `mpd_hashline_edit` is VALID (bundle row). Do not let anyone \"clean up\" those.\n   - TRAP, forbidden: do NOT filter the deny list with `dsh.hasTool`. It reads the GLOBAL view only, so `write`/`edit`/`bash` (registered on the agent plane by the mpd preset) report FALSE — filtering would SILENTLY drop them and leave read-only children un-guarded. Only the optional MCP names (`mcp__ast_grep__rewrite|scan`, `mcp__lsp__rename`) may be hasTool-filtered.\n   - t17 also needs the real-harness proof: a LIVE read-only `mpd_role_spawn` that starts and whose child gets UNKNOWN_TOOL on `write`.\n\n2) IDENTITY RULE (closes the D5 hazard): the instance key IS the directory name; `meta.name` is a display mirror, repaired on the next write, never trusted for path resolution. This is what makes an interrupted rename harmless. `wmDir(\"\")` must throw — today `wmDir(\"\")` IS the library root.\n\n3) Name validation (both args of rename, and delete): accept iff `raw === sanitizeName(raw) && raw !== \"\"`, cap 255. Verified superset of every existing key → no instance becomes un-addressable; closes \"Alice\", CJK, \"a/b\", \"..\", and \".archive\"→\"archive\".\n\n4) IN-USE GATE (D2) is implementable with NO cross-plugin service: (a) an in-process `Map<key,count>` around `dsh.spawnAgent`; (b) read `<workspace>/.mpd/team/<teamId>/team.json` direct children (archived teams live under `.mpd/team/archive/**`, so they are excluded by construction), match `workmateKey(member.name)`. READ permitted, WRITE to `.mpd/team` forbidden. Fail-open on any read error. Gate + FS mutation in ONE synchronous block (no await between) ⇒ race-free in-process, no lock file needed.\n   WARNING for t16/t18: this repo already holds SIX stale non-archived team records under `.mpd/team/` (mpd-default, mpd-default-53380813, -84e50f06, -c146a414, -c2be0a8a, agent-teams-sidebar-migration), all with members named Planner/Researcher/… — so any workmate named after a roster role is blocked from rename/delete until those teams are archived. That is why the refusal text MUST name the blocking team id and member.\n\n5) Surface pinned exactly: tools `mpd_workmate_rename{name,new_name}` and `mpd_workmate_delete{name,purge?,confirm?}` (purge requires confirm === name), service gains exactly `rename`/`delete`, routes `POST /plugins/mpd-workmate/{rename,delete}` with a full status-code/body table, archive layout `~/.mpd/workmate/.archive/<key>-<compactUtcStamp>/` (colons stripped for Windows), loop-safe against every edge case I could raise (repeat delete → 404 deliberately, not idempotent; case-only rename rejected; symlink refused rather than resolved).\n\nNo blockers. t15/t16/t17 are unblocked the moment this is read; recommend t17 gets the deny-list split FIRST since it is a one-line-class fix with a live-harness proof."}],"source":{"kind":"plugin","plugin":"dsh-agent-teams"},"role":"user","id":"88946f41-8005-4f24-ae1c-5d6df414ab29"}]}}
