-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning high\n  - Senior Engineer [primary implementation] idle/ready · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\n  - Junior Engineer [small mechanical changes] idle/ready · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning high\nTasks (11):\n  - t1 [completed] requirements r1 verdict pass attempt 1 Requirements contract + pinned wire protocol for workmate rename/delete → Planner\n      output: CONTRACT v1 — workmate rename + delete (binding for t15/t16/t17/t18/t22/t23)\n\n═══════════ A. GROUND TRUTH (verified by reading, cited) ═══════════\nA1 packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/src/index.ts (439L): sanitizeName:58, wmDir:55, workmateRoot:54, readMeta:81, writeJson:89 (mkdirs \"..\"), indexPath:94/re\n  - t2 [pending] work attempt 2 Project traversal dossier: the workmate system in full bundle context → Researcher\n  - t15 [pending] implementation r1 attempt 1 Implement workmate rename + delete core: tools, service, routes, safety, tests → Senior Engineer (deps: t1)\n  - t16 [pending] implementation r1 attempt 0 Workmates sidebar tab: rename + delete controls (zh/en) and rebuilt client → Junior Engineer (deps: t1)\n  - t17 [pending] implementation r1 attempt 1 Fix read-only deny lists so read-only spawn works on the real harness → Deep Worker (deps: t1)\n  - t18 [pending] verification r1 attempt 0 Independent verification: rename/delete end-to-end, negative cases, full gate sweep → Reviewer (deps: t15,t16,t17)\n  - t19 [pending] review r1 attempt 0 Review: core rename/delete implementation (safety, identity, atomicity, races) → Architect (deps: t15)\n  - t20 [pending] review r1 attempt 0 Review: Workmates tab rename/delete UI, zh/en strings, rebuilt client → Plan Reviewer (deps: t16)\n  - t21 [pending] review r1 attempt 0 Review: read-only deny-list fix and its real-harness proof → Senior Engineer (deps: t17)\n  - t22 [pending] implementation r1 attempt 0 Bilingual docs + QA assertion sync for workmate rename/delete → Lead (deps: t1,t15,t16,t17,t18)\n  - t23 [pending] integration r1 attempt 0 Integrate and report: rename/delete + read-only fix + docs as one coherent change → Lead (deps: t1,t2,t18,t19,t20,t21,t22)\nCoverage:\n  - 1. 可以给workmate改名: passed (t1)\n  - 2. 可以删除workmate: passed (t1)\n  - 遍历工程，了解工程详细信息: passed (t1)\nDelivery: blocked (t15 (implementation) is not completed; t16 (implementation) is not completed; t17 (implementation) is not completed; t18 (verification) is not completed; t19 (review) is not completed; t20 (review) is not completed; t21 (review) is not completed; t22 (implementation) is not completed; t23 (integration) is not completed)\nCaptain inbox (0):\nMember inbox Researcher (1): latest — Captain → Researcher. You now own t2 (project traversal dossier), reassigned from Explorer whose attempt died with zero \nMember inbox Reviewer (1): latest — Captain → Reviewer. Pre-task guidance for t18 (verification), so your evidence is correctly attributed from the start.\n\n\nMember inbox Lead (1): latest — Captain → Lead. Pre-task guidance for t22 (docs/QA sync) and t23 (integration report).\n\n1) BASELINE (state it, do not ch\nMember inbox Deep Worker (1): latest — Captain → Deep Worker. CORRECTION to finding #1 of the t1 contract — this overrides it for t17. I verified it live, twic\nMember inbox Senior Engineer (1): latest — Captain → Senior Engineer. CORRECTION affecting t15 (workmate-side READONLY_DENY at packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/src/ind\nMember inbox Junior Engineer (1): latest — Captain → Junior Engineer. Answer to your baseline question (the team went running before I could put this in the plan t"}],"isError":false}],"role":"user","id":"51d08a5f-44ed-4e26-a41a-1ba68e8eaff7"}},"sourceEventSeqs":[91952],"surfaceOp":"append"}
