rom scratch or re-opening the five agreed user decisions\", \"Implementing anything\", \"Editing any file (read-only role; the contract file is the captain's)\"], \"objective\": \"Independently validate the preserved rename/delete contract against the real code and the live harness, and return only the corrections/additions that matter — so the implementations build on a contract that is provably true rather than merely plausible.\", \"round\": 1, \"subject\": \"Validate the preserved rename/delete contract against the real code and live harness\"}"},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_01_lW4iG8xQt9XHq4ooL0bl0167","name":"agent_teams_create_task","arguments":"{\"deliverables\": [\"whole-repo traversal map, one line per package/dir with what it actually does (task output text)\", \"workmate coupling + stale-surface map with file:line anchors (task output text)\", \"gates, QA isolation and evidence conventions (task output text)\", \"contradictions found between docs and code (task output text)\"], \"description\": \"The user asked for a genuine traversal of this project (\\\"遍历工程，了解工程详细信息\\\"), so this task delivers the whole-project picture with the workmate system located inside it. A previous attempt at this task died with ZERO output; that failure mode is the single most important thing to avoid here.\\n\\nHARD DELIVERY RULES:\\n- Target roughly 150-200 lines of dense structured text in your task output. No pasted source, no per-package essays.\\n- If you cannot finish everything, STOP and deliver what you have with an explicit trailing line \\\"PARTIAL — not covered: <sections>\\\". A labelled partial is strictly better than a silent death.\\n- Never end your turn with this task claimed and no output. Complete it, or fail it with the concrete blocker.\\n\\nDO NOT re-derive the workmate internals in depth — .mpd/plans/workmate-rename-delete-contract.md already pins sanitizeName, the wmDir(\\\"\\\") hazard, the index.json writer-with-no-reader, the tool/route surface, 