e picture, and any doc-vs-code contradictions — bounded enough to land inside one turn.\", \"subject\": \"Project traversal dossier: the workmate system in full bundle context\"}"}],"source":{"kind":"model","provider":"deepseek-official","model":"deepseek-v4-flash"},"id":"447ed843-d1a4-4860-99db-086c550e42a4"},"usage":{"inputTokens":220,"outputTokens":2462,"totalTokens":215034,"cacheReadTokens":212352,"reasoningTokens":542}},"sourceEventSeqs":[[106659,108961]],"surfaceOp":"append"}
