elete-contract.md (BINDING — especially section D's route/status/reason table, which is what you must call and branch on) and the t1 validation output for corrections. Do not invent route shapes; if the UI needs something the contract does not define, report it in your output instead of guessing.\\n\\nSource of truth: packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/src/web-client.js — the WorkmateLibraryView component, the request() helper, WORKMATE_LOCALE_NAMESPACE (zh + en; zh is the key-set source of truth), SIDEBAR_TAB_ID=\\\"mpd-workmate\\\" and registerWorkmateSidebarTab. The tab is sidebar-only BY DESIGN (the old overlay floater and footer toggle were deliberately removed and the build fails if they return), it is single: true, and optional seams must be probed through ctx.get behind a helper that never throws — a declared-but-unregistered service takes the whole page down (see the AGENTS.md troubleshooting rows and packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/test/sidebar-tab.test.mjs).\\n\\nYou MUST rebuild the shipped client after editing: `node scripts/build-mpd-client.mjs`. Verified by the captain: the pre-existing client.js is fresher than its source (rebuilt 15:36 vs source 15:27) and already carries the current markers, so it is not stale — after your edit, diff client.js against the pre-existing version rather than against HEAD.\\n\\nBASELINE: the 33 uncommitted entries in the tree are the BASELINE, not yours. Never commit/stash/revert them, capture HEAD + `git status --porcelain` before and after, and report only your own changed paths.\\n\\nDo not end the turn with this task claimed and no output: complete it with structured results, or fail it with a concrete blocker.\", \"inScope\": [\"packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/src/web-client.js\", \"packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/test/\", \"packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/client.js\", \"evidence/workmate/rename-delete-gui/\"], \"kind\": \"implementation\", \"nonGoals\": [\"Adding or changing host-side routes and tools (the core task owns them)\", \"The AgentTeams page except where a test requires keeping its assertions intact\", \"Documentation and QA scripts (the docs task owns them)\"], \"objective\": \"Give the Workmates sidebar tab a real rename and delete flow wired to the contract's wire protocol: rename with a prefilled input, delete behind an explicit confirmation that matches archive-first semantics, bilingual (zh/en) strings with identical key sets, correct stale-selection handling after a mutation, distinct readable messages per refusal reason, and a rebuilt packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/client.js so the change actually ships.\", \"outOfScope\": [\"packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/\", \"packages/mpd-roles-plugin/\", \"packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/src/team-page.js\", \"AGENTS.md\", \"docs/\"], \"round\": 1, \"subject\": \"Workmates sidebar tab: rename + delete controls (zh/en) and rebuilt client\", \"verify\": [\"node scripts/build-mpd-client.mjs\", \"bun test packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/test\", \"bun run typecheck\"]}"}}}}
