evidence/agent-teams/scheduler-wakeup-fix/2026-09-10T10-16-23Z/captain-session-f333e946.jsonl:4621:{"type":"assistant/chunk","seq":116286,"time":1789029554733,"data":{"turn":5,"step":8,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_6RrbslUdGASFzBabzJ3C1252","name":"agent_teams_create_task","arguments":"{\"acceptance\": [\"Wire-contract conformance is verified call by call against contract section D (path, verb, payload, status handling, reason branching); any drift is a finding.\", \"Every refusal reason (invalid-name, unknown, collision, in-use, confirm-required) is surfaced distinctly and readably, and the in-use message names the blocking team and member from the refusal body.\", \"Every string the change adds exists in both the zh and en dictionaries with identical key sets; a missing key in either language is at least a high finding, and the Chinese wording is judged for naturalness, not just presence.\", \"The destructive flow is human-safe: explicit confirmation, wording that matches archive-first semantics (the user must not be misled into thinking data is destroyed when it is archived, or vice versa), and no single click that irreversibly destroys a workmate.\", \"The sidebar design constraints hold in the shipped artifact: still sidebar-only with no floating fallback or footer toggle, single: true, no stale detail polling or 404 loop after a mutation, no unguarded service declaration reintroduced, and the rebuilt client.js actually contains the new UI.\", \"The UI is judged against the LATEST code state, including any repair that already ran.\", \"Verdict=pass only with zero unresolved blocker/high findings; otherwise the task FAILS with structured findings (id, severity, problem, requiredFix) naming the exact file and required correction.\"], \"dependencies\": [\"t4\"], \"description\": \"Review the GUI work (t4) as both a contract-conformance reviewer and a UI/UX critic. Read .mpd/plans/workmate-rename-delete-contract.md 