ted with structured results or failed with a concrete blocker — never left claimed with no output.\"], \"dependencies\": [\"t1\", \"t3\", \"t4\", \"t5\", \"t6\"], \"description\": \"Sync every documentation and QA-assertion surface with what actually shipped, in both languages, in one coherent pass. Start from the t6 verification evidence and the contract at .mpd/plans/workmate-rename-delete-contract.md so the docs describe verified behaviour rather than intentions.\\n\\nBinding repo rules: agent-facing content (AGENTS.md, code comments, QA scripts) is English-only; every human-facing doc ships BOTH English and 简体中文 *.zh-CN.md, kept in sync in the same change, each with the language switch link directly under its title; process artifacts (docs/plan-*.md, docs/decisions.md, prior-phase reports) and internal QA/golden reference docs are exempt from the bilingual rule. Update only docs that genuinely enumerate workmate capability — do not mass-rewrite docs that merely mention the word.\\n\\nIf the t2 dossier flagged a doc-vs-code contradiction touching the workmate surface, fix it here.\\n\\nScope boundary: do not change implementation code (t3/t4/t5 own it) and do not touch the read-only-spawn QA case or its SKILL.md row (t5 owns them) — append your rows without disturbing theirs.\", \"inScope\": [\"AGENTS.md\", \"README.md\", \"README.zh-CN.md\", \"docs/\", \"packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/README.md\", \"packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/README.zh-CN.md\", \"packages/mpd-bundle/README.md\", \"packages/mpd-bundle/README.zh-CN.md\", \"packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/README.md\", \"packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/README.zh-CN.md\", \"packages/mpd-bundle/cordis.patch.yml\", \"presets/\", \"skills/dsh-qa/scripts/workmate-library.mjs\", \"skills/dsh-qa/scripts/web-client-adapt.mjs\", \"skills/dsh-qa/SKILL.md\", \"evidence/workmate/rename-delete-docs/\"], \"kind\": \"implementation\", \"nonGoals\": [\"Changing implementation code\", \"The read-only-spawn QA case and its SKILL.md row (t5 owns them)\", \"Mass-rewriting docs that only mention the word workmate in passing\", \"Translating internal process artifacts exempt from the bilingual rule\"], \"objective\": \"Bring every human-facing document (bilingual EN + zh-CN), the agent-facing manual, the preset/bundle texts and the QA assertions in line with the shipped rename/delete feature and the read-only deny fix — so no surface still describes the old tool set, the removed dead names are documented, and every documented statement matches what verification proved.\", \"outOfScope\": [\"packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/src/\", \"packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/src/\", \"packages/mpd-roles-plugin/src/\"], \"round\": 1, \"subject\": \"Bilingual docs + QA assertion sync for workmate rename/delete\", \"verify\": [\"bun run test:qa\", \"bun test packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/test\", \"bun run typecheck\"]}"}}}}
