 in passing\", \"Translating internal process artifacts exempt from the bilingual rule\"], \"objective\": \"Bring every human-facing document (bilingual EN + zh-CN), the agent-facing manual, the preset/bundle texts and the QA assertions in line with the shipped rename/delete feature and the read-only deny fix — so no surface still describes the old tool set, the removed dead names are documented, and every documented statement matches what verification proved.\", \"outOfScope\": [\"packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/src/\", \"packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/src/\", \"packages/mpd-roles-plugin/src/\"], \"round\": 1, \"subject\": \"Bilingual docs + QA assertion sync for workmate rename/delete\", \"verify\": [\"bun run test:qa\", \"bun test packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/test\", \"bun run typecheck\"]}"}}
