gration/\", \"AGENTS.md\", \"docs/\", \"README.md\", \"README.zh-CN.md\", \"packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/README.md\", \"packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/README.zh-CN.md\"], \"kind\": \"integration\", \"nonGoals\": [\"Changing implementation code to make a gate pass\", \"Restarting or redoing a review that already returned pass\", \"Re-litigating the five agreed user decisions\"], \"objective\": \"Integrate the verified and reviewed rename/delete feature, the read-only deny fix and the documentation sync into one coherent, gate-clean change: persist the contract, validation and dossier as on-disk evidence, re-run the full gate sweep on the final tree, reconcile documentation against the shipped code, and report what changed, what was proven, what was deliberately not done, and what remains open.\", \"outOfScope\": [\"packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/src/\", \"packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/src/\", \"packages/mpd-roles-plugin/src/\", \"skills/dsh-qa/scripts/\"], \"round\": 1, \"subject\": \"Integrate and report: rename/delete + read-only fix + docs as one coherent change\", \"verify\": [\"bun test packages\", \"bun run typecheck\", \"bun run test:qa\", \"node scripts/verify-vendor.mjs\"]}"}}
