evidence/agent-teams/scheduler-wakeup-fix/2026-09-10T10-16-23Z/captain-session-f333e946.jsonl:4877:{"type":"tool/result","seq":121970,"time":1789029638599,"data":{"turn":6,"step":1,"message":{"source":{"kind":"tool","callId":"call_01_57ZNi05ftGtgJhXhnax81846"},"content":[{"type":"tool-result","toolCallId":"call_01_57ZNi05ftGtgJhXhnax81846","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Team \"workmate-rename-delete\" — Add rename + delete to the workmate system (mpd-workmate-plugin) and fix the read-only deny-list defect that blocks every read-only spawn. Rebuilt team: the previous team's scheduler stalled and its Explorer attempt died with the API, so this is a fresh scheduler with the same DAG. The binding interface document is preserved at .mpd/plans/workmate-rename-delete-contract.md and must be read by every member. Five user decisions are already agreed (archive-first delete with explicit purge; refuse mutations while the workmate is in use with a full library-owned cascade; the read-only deny defect in scope; agent tools + web routes + Workmates sidebar tab in zh/en; ASCII-only naming). Binding gates: bun test packages, bun run typecheck, bun run test:qa, node scripts/verify-vendor.mjs, and an isolated-DSH_HOME boot check, with evidence on disk and bilingual docs.\nProfile: mpd [captain] — Read-only members (Architect, Researcher, Planner, Explorer, Plan Reviewer, Vision Analyst) take requirements/review/analysis tasks only and never edit files. Workers (Senior Engineer, Junior Engineer, Deep Worker, Lead, Reviewer) take impl\nLoop: running — Work remains on the shared task list; wait for the scheduler or complete owned tasks.\nViewing as: captain\nMembers (11):\n  - Architect [architecture review / deep debugging / self-review] working/running · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\n  - Researcher [code / open-source evidence search] working/running · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\n  - Planner [planning / task decomposition] working/running · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\n  - Explorer [read-only codebase exploration] working/running · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\n  - Reviewer [correctness / risk review] working/running · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\n  - Plan Reviewer [work-plan QA review / UI-UX critique] working/running · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\n  - Vision Analyst [image / diagram analysis] idle/ready · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash-vision-exp · reasoning high\n  - Lead [orchestration / integration] idle/ready · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\n  - Deep Worker [autonomous goal-driven implementation] working/running · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\n  - Senior Engineer [primary implementation] working/running · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\n  - Junior Engineer [small mechanical changes] working/running · deepseek-official/deepseek-v4-flash · reasoning max\nTasks (11):\n  - t1 [in_progress] requirements r1 attempt 1 Validate the preserved rename/delete contract against the real code and live harness → Planner\n  - t2 [claimed] work attempt 1 Project traversal dossier: the workmate system in full bundle context → Researcher\n  - t3 [pending] implementation r1 attempt 0 Implement workmate rename + delete core: tools, service, routes, safety, tests → Senior Engineer (deps: t1)\n  - t4 [pending] implementation r1 attempt 0 Workmates sidebar tab: rename + delete controls (zh/en) and rebuilt client → Junior Engineer (deps: t1)\n  - t5 [pending] implementation r1 attempt 0 Fix read-only deny lists so read-only spawn works on the real harness → Deep Worker (deps: t1)\n  - t6 [pending] verification r1 attempt 0 Independent verification: rename/delete end-to-end, negative cases, full gate sweep → Reviewer (deps: t3,t4,t5)\n  - t7 [pending] review r1 attempt 0 Review: core rename/delete implementation (safety, identity, atomicity, races) → Architect (deps: t3)\n  - t8 [pending] review r1 attempt 0 Review: Workmates tab rename/delete UI, zh/en strings, rebuilt client → Plan Reviewer (deps: t4)\n  - t9 [pending] review r1 attempt 0 Review: read-only deny-list fix and its real-harness proof → Senior Engineer (deps: t5)\n  - t10 [pending] implementation r1 attempt 0 Bilingual docs + QA assertion sync for workmate rename/delete → Lead (deps: t1,t3,t4,t5,t6)\n  - t11 [pending] integration r1 attempt 0 Integrate and report: rename/delete + read-only fix + docs as one coherent change → Lead (deps: t1,t2,t6,t7,t8,t9,t10)\nDelivery: blocked (t1 (requirements) is not completed; t3 (implementation) is not completed; t4 (implementation) is not completed; t5 (implementation) is not completed; t6 (verification) is not completed; t7 (review) is not completed; t8 (review) is not completed; t9 (review) is not completed; t10 (implementation) is not completed; t11 (integration) is not completed)\nCaptain inbox (0):\nMember inbox Vision Analyst (1): latest — Captain → Vision Analyst. Standing answer, so you do not need to ask again: there is NO image/screenshot task for you in"}],"isError":false}],"role":"user","id":"6505bf5b-bb26-415e-b78b-5165891f5efe"}},"sourceEventSeqs":[121969],"surfaceOp":"append"}
evidence/agent-teams/scheduler-wakeup-fix/2026-09-10T10-16-23Z/captain-session-f333e946.jsonl:4883:{"type":"user/message","seq":121976,"time":1789029641729,"data":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Agent b6ae16f7-2010-48dc-982d-5a5be4790b79 sent a message:"},{"type":"text","text":"Lead (workmate-rename-delete) — status: IDLE, no claim made.\n\nTeam \"workmate-rename-delete\" is live with 11 members and an 11-task DAG. I own 2 pending tasks, both correctly blocked upstream:\n- t10 [implementation] Bilingual docs + QA assertion sync for workmate rename/delete — deps t1,t3,t4,t5,t6\n- t11 [integration] Integrate and report: rename/delete + read-only fix + docs as one coherent change — deps t1,t2,t6,t7,t8,t9,t10\n\nPer the assignment rule I did NOT claim either: no dependency has started (t1 requirements, t3/t4/t5 implementations, t6 verification all still pending), so claiming would be work on blocked upstream. Delivery is blocked exactly on t1 not being completed plus the downstream impl/verify/review tasks.\n\nNo action needed from you right now. I will pick up t10 when t1/t3/t4/t5/t6 are terminal, then t11 after the review tasks (t7/t8/t9) land. If you want me to start earlier — e.g. drafting the bilingual docs skeleton against the preserved contract at .mpd/plans/workmate-rename-delete-contract.md before implementations finish — send that instruction and I will claim t10 with it in scope."}],"source":{"kind":"agent-message","form":"relay","senderSessionId":"b6ae16f7-2010-48dc-982d-5a5be4790b79"},"role":"user","id":"f0cca0c7-a001-4d1c-b9dc-e774db89510a"},"surfaceOp":"append"}
