evidence/agent-teams/scheduler-wakeup-fix/2026-09-10T10-16-23Z/captain-session-f333e946.jsonl:4910:{"type":"agent/inbox/spliced","seq":122601,"time":1789029651360,"data":{"target":"next-step","start":2,"inserted":[{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Background subagent 1609c6e9-4269-4942-9329-2f733d235455 finished and will do no further work unless you send it more."},{"type":"text","text":"Its closing message:"},{"type":"text","text":"**Standing by — no work started yet.**\n\n## What I did this turn\n\n1. **Read the binding contract** in full (`.mpd/plans/workmate-rename-delete-contract.md`, 146 lines): §A five user decisions, §B identity/name rules, §C tool surface, §D exact HTTP protocol table, §E in-use gate, §F rename cascade, §G captain-corrected deny list, §H edge-case matrix, §I gates/baseline/evidence rules.\n2. **Froze the baseline** for my later delta report: HEAD `f69708809ed63a57461aa6730d297afc09e772a3`, 33 porcelain entries — matches §I's stated baseline, so the tree is untouched by me.\n3. **Confirmed §G is still unfixed at source** (pre-finding, sent to captain): both dead names `str_replace_editor` / `apply_patch` remain in `READONLY_DENY` in `packages/mpd-roles-plugin/src/index.ts` (lines 26-27) and `packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/src/index.ts` (line 30), plus their `dist/` copies. Also noted `packages/mpd-roles-plugin/test/roles.test.ts:106` pins the old list and must move in the same change as t5.\n\n## Status\n\n- **My task t6** (independent verification: rename/delete end-to-end, negative cases, full gate sweep) is assigned to me but **pending** — dependencies t3, t4, t5 are all still pending. It is not ready, so I deliberately did **not** claim it: verifying an implementation that does not exist yet would produce worthless evidence and burn the attempt.\n- No teammates were told to start anything; I am not creating tasks or reassigning work.\n- I will claim t6 and run it the moment the scheduler unlocks it, verifying against the live harness with `HOME=<sandbox>` per §I, and will send the full result to my parent session at that point."}],"source":{"kind":"subagent-settled","form":"notice","summary":"Background subagent 1609c6e9-4269-4942-9329-2f733d235455 finished and will do no further work unless you send it more.","senderSessionId":"1609c6e9-4269-4942-9329-2f733d235455"},"role":"user","id":"c2f7224f-3c55-4866-892f-829d8ef154ef"}]}}
