cross four distinct failures (400 invalid-name, 400 confirm-required, 404 unknown, 409 collision, 409 in-use) — so as written the UI cannot make the in-use refusal name the blocking team+member that decision D2 explicitly requires. Also flagged: stale detail selection after rename/delete; zh/en key-set identity; delete needing an explicit confirmation step; and one open scope question for the captain — the tab-strip label is a hardcoded `\"Workmates\"` constant, so it is not localized even though D4 lists the tab itself as a zh/en surface.\n\nI'll claim t8 the moment t4 lands, and will judge it from source, tests, built artifact and route contract — explicitly *not* claiming visual verification, since the sandbox has no browser driver."}],"source":{"kind":"subagent-settled","form":"notice","summary":"Background subagent 122fd3af-96c0-411e-9501-fe84b690b4bd finished and will do no further work unless you send it more.","senderSessionId":"122fd3af-96c0-411e-9501-fe84b690b4bd"},"role":"user","id":"9804af87-a294-47e2-b623-ed5b42ed4914"},"surfaceOp":"append"}
