solves to the LIBRARY ROOT (src/index.ts:55): require `raw === sanitizeName(raw) && raw !== \\\"\\\"` at the top of both tools, before any fs call.\\n   - `mpd_workmate_spawn` must decrement its in-process in-use counter in a `finally` (throw path included), else one failed spawn leaks a permanent in-use block.\\n   - `mpdWorkmate.delete` must be declared as an object-literal property (`delete: (…) => …`); a bare `delete(...)` member is a parse error.\\n\\n3) Contract §K records a captain decision so you do not re-litigate it: the sidebar tab-STRIP label stays hardcoded English \\\"Workmates\\\" in this change (the page body is zh/en; the strip label is resolved at tab-registration time where no localized `t` is in scope, and the sibling AgentTeams tab behaves the same). Documented deferral, not a finding.\\n\\nRebuild packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/dist after your source change — the repo runs dist. Do not end the turn with t3 claimed and no output.\", \"to\": \"Senior Engineer\"}"}}
