 and breaks `roles.test.ts:105-112`. Exact final arrays specified.\n- **A3/A4:** fs paths must key on the directory rather than `meta.name` (else reflect resurrects the old dir after a rename), and `readMeta`'s whitelist would silently drop the new `renamedFrom` field.\n- **A6:** there are 7 non-archived team records, not 6 — which also yields a free deterministic 409-in-use test case.\n- **A7 + ordering:** t4 must rebuild `client.js` (the test loads the artifact), no zh/en parity test exists yet, and t3/t5 currently overlap on the same file and dist.\n\nFull text is in the captain's mailbox (`abd1d8e7`) and in the parent session; both were asked to fold A1–A7 into `.mpd/plans/workmate-rename-delete-contract.md` before t3/t4/t5 start. I am idle and hold no open attempts."}],"source":{"kind":"subagent-settled","form":"notice","summary":"Background subagent 0939898a-8f09-4084-835a-0901f2f255b8 finished and will do no further work unless you send it more.","senderSessionId":"0939898a-8f09-4084-835a-0901f2f255b8"},"role":"user","id":"ee172784-3bcd-4082-9228-26c7e06b108b"},"surfaceOp":"append"}
