t the workmate READONLY_DENY and raise it to the same seven names as the roles list; A3 key all fs paths on the directory, never meta.name; A4 add renamedFrom to the readMeta whitelist; A5 rewrite only the leading identity prefix in note.md.\\n\\nDo not end the turn with t3 claimed and no output.\", \"to\": \"Senior Engineer\"}"},{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_01_Lp9PjkI7CDNXNYa4tl6m0967","name":"agent_teams_send_message","arguments":"{\"content\": \"Captain → Junior Engineer (t4). The t2 dossier found two hard blockers in your test path; both are now binding contract section M and are IN YOUR SCOPE to fix. Read §D, §K, §L A7 and §M before you code.\\n\\nM8 — THE HARNESS MUST GROW (otherwise your tests cannot prove the contract):\\n- packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/test/client-harness.mjs `fetchImpl` (L327-332) can express only a 200 body or a 404 {error}. The 409 collision, 409 in-use and 400 confirm-required / invalid-name bodies are NOT expressible, so §D's \\\"branch on reason\\\" cannot be tested. Extend the stub with a request->response table so each reason path is exercisable.\\n- `ctx.locale.register` (L294) discards the {zh,en} dictionaries, so A7's key-parity assertion (`Object.keys(zh).sort()` vs `Object.keys(en).sort()`) is impossible until you capture the second argument in the harness or export the dictionaries. Do whichever is smaller.\\nExtending that test infrastructure is in scope for t4 — it is not \\\"extra work beyond the task\\\".\\n\\nReason codes the UI must handle end to end (all five, each with a distinct readable message): 400 \\\"invalid-name\\\" (includes the same-key rename case, which M2 decides is 400 rather than 409), 400 \\\"confirm-required\\\" (purge without confirm === name), 404 \\\"unknown\\\" (including a repeat delete), 409 \\\"collision\\\", 409 \\\"in-use\\\" (with blocking:[{teamId, member}]).\\n\\nM7 — never edit stale mirrors: .qa-reloc/**, dist/mpd-package/** and tracked evidence/scan/** copies also contain a client.js; the live artifact is packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/client.js only, and it must be regenerated with `node scripts/build-mpd-client.mjs` in the same change because test/sidebar-tab.test.mjs:17 loads the COMMITTED artifact.\\n\\n§K still stands: the tab-STRIP label stays hardcoded English \\\"Workmates\\\" — documented deferral, not a finding, do not spend effort localizing it. And §L A7 stands too: request() must carry status + reason + blocking into the error path.\\n\\nDo not end the turn with t4 claimed and no output.\", \"to\": \"Junior Engineer\"}"}],"source":{"kind":"model","provider":"deepseek-official","model":"deepseek-v4-flash"},"id":"89038979-6f00-44e0-886d-28654d359e87"},"usage":{"inputTokens":804,"outputTokens":1609,"totalTokens":272877,"cacheReadTokens":270464,"reasoningTokens":424}},"sourceEventSeqs":[[145670,147216]],"surfaceOp":"append"}
