evidence/agent-teams/scheduler-wakeup-fix/2026-09-10T10-16-23Z/captain-session-f333e946.jsonl:5977:{"type":"assistant/chunk","seq":150320,"time":1789030162385,"data":{"turn":8,"step":5,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"`t1` 与 `t2` 都已完成，`t3/t4/t5` 的依赖已满足——但它们停在 attempt 0、全员 idle，且 90 秒内无任何文件写入。这与我观察到的规律一致：**成员回合只在队长回合之间被调度**，所以我现在结束本轮，把窗口让给调度器。\n\n## 本轮成果（这一轮的实际产出都在\"纠偏\"上）\n\n**t1（契约校验）verdict=pass**，并给出全绿基线：`bun test packages` 215 通过 / 0 失败、typecheck exit 0、`verify-vendor` PASS、`test:qa` 全过，且该成员**未改动任何文件**（HEAD 与 33 项未提交条目前后一致）。\n\n**t2（遍历档案）完成**，独立在**两个调用点**复现了 deny 缺陷（`mpd_role_spawn{librarian}` 与 `mpd_workmate_spawn{oracle-1}`），抓到完整 104 项活注册表——契约里的 7 名单**逐个可注册**，两个死名字确实都不存在。\n\n## 我在这一轮做的裁决（全部写入契约，成员随时可读）\n\n- **A2 两个 deny 列表对齐**（我拍板）：workmate 侧补齐到与 roles 侧相同的 7 项，闭合\"只读 workmate 可经 bash 写文件\"这个被缺陷掩盖的洞，并加**两数组相等的守卫测试**消除漂移。\n- **§M 五项缺口裁决**：只读实例**允许**被改名/删除（属库管理，非 workmate 自改）；同名改名 → `400 invalid-name`；无 `meta.json` 的孤儿目录 → `404 unknown` 零副作用；**带旧键的 reflect 不解析 `renamedFrom`**（绝不复活目录）；冲突判定改用 `lstat` 并把**任何**命中（含\"改名到已存在的空目录会静默成功\"、悬空软链）统一映射为 `409 collision`。\n- **M6**：门禁固定读 `<cwd>/.mpd/team`（配置查询返回 null，不加查找）；并提醒 QA 是 `HOME=<sandbox>` 但 `cwd=repo`，所以沙箱用例同样要避开角色名。\n- **M7**：禁止改动镜像副本（`.qa-reloc/**`、`dist/mpd-package/**`、已跟踪的 `evidence/scan/**`）。\n- **M8**：t4 必须扩展测试桩（`fetchImpl` 目前只能表达 200/404，无法表达 409/400 的 `reason` 体；`locale.register` 丢弃 zh/en 字典导致键一致性断言无法写）——扩展测试基础设施明确算在 t4 范围内。\n- 三条定向指令已投递到 t3/t4/t5/t6 邮箱（Senior Engineer 3 封、Deep Worker 2 封、Junior Engineer 2 封、Reviewer 1 封，均未被读取——正是调度未派发的证据）。\n\n## 下一步与升级预案\n\n结束本轮后，调度器应拉取 `t3/t4/t5`（三者文件零重叠，可并行）。**若你看到它们仍停在 attempt 0、成员持续 idle**，那就是调度器再次假死——届时按你上次的判断直接重建队伍，我会先抢救两处只存在于任务记录里的产出（t2 档案全文、t1 校验输出）再拆队，避免重复劳动。你也可以直接说一声\"重建\"，我立刻执行。"}}}}
evidence/agent-teams/scheduler-wakeup-fix/2026-09-10T10-16-23Z/captain-session-f333e946.jsonl:5980:{"type":"assistant/message","seq":150323,"time":1789030162387,"data":{"turn":8,"step":5,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"reasoning","text":"No file activity. Let me check status once to see if tasks moved.\n\nIf still stalled, my options:\n1. Try reassign on t3/t4/t5 (earlier it didn't wake members, but it does revoke/issue attempts — cheap).\n2. Salvage the t2 dossier + t1 output to disk BEFORE any rebuild (so nothing is lost).\n3. Ask the user? They already told me the remedy: rebuild the team. But rebuilding repeatedly is a treadmill; and each rebuild loses member context (they've all read the contract, done recon).\n\nHmm, wait. Let me think about the dispatch mechanism differently. Maybe the scheduler dispatches when a task becomes ready *and* the team loop ticks. The loop said \"running\" with \"wait for the scheduler\"...\n\nAlternatively — maybe the issue is that member turns require the CAPTAIN to be idle, and my turn (with a 90s sleep) blocks. The previous successful dispatch (t1/t2) happened right after I ended a turn (the user's message started a new turn and members were already working). Actually, at the start of THIS turn (the messages from Researcher/Planner), t1 and t2 were completed — implying they ran while I was idle between turns. Yes! t2 completed between my turns.\n\nSo the pattern is consistent: **members run while the captain is idle (between turns); they don't run during my turn.** That explains everything:\n- First team: t1/t2 ran between my turns; then the user interrupted with \"T2好像执行失败了\" → my turn started → nothing ran during it; my reassigns/messages queued.\n- This team: t1/t2 ran between turns; now t3/t4/t5 should run... but my turn is open, so they wait.\n\nBut hold on: earlier in this session I observed \"9 members working/running\" DURING my turn (in the Vision-Analyst reply turn). Hmm, that contradicts... unless they were finishing turns that started before my turn began.\n\nMost likely: dispatch tick happens at captain-turn boundaries (when I end my turn) or on a timer that also depends on captain idleness.\n\nGiven that, the CORRECT action now is: **end my turn quickly** so the scheduler can dispatch t3/t4/t5. That's exactly the guidance I gave earlier (\"成员回合是在队长回合之间执行的，所以我会保持短回合让调度器推进\").\n\nBut: is there any risk that ending the turn leaves nothing to resume? No — the tasks are ready and assigned; the scheduler will pick them up. And the runtime notifies me when members report.\n\nHowever, the user might be waiting for a status update. My last user-facing message covered the amendments; now I should give a SHORT status: t1/t2 done, contract amended with §L/§M, and t3/t4/t5 are ready and will be dispatched when my turn ends (i.e., imminently). Also flag: if they don't start within a minute or two, tell me and I'll take the escalation path (reassign → rebuild), and note I've already salvaged... hmm, should I salvage the t2 dossier now? \n\nLet me do a quick, cheap safety net: write the t2 dossier essentials? I don't have the full dossier text (only the summary + status-truncated output). Salvaging properly would require reading the task output, which the status truncates. Hmm. `.mpd/team/.../team.json` holds it — reading THAT is what I'm told not to do for plan revision... but this would be for salvage. The rule says \"Never inspect or edit .agent-teams state files or plugin source code to revise a plan.\" My purpose isn't plan revision, but I'd rather respect the letter. The dossier's key content is already in my context via the Researcher's message (items 1-7 are the important parts). And the Lead (t11) is tasked to persist it. If a rebuild becomes necessary, I'd ask the Researcher to redo it (cheap-ish) — or better: instruct the Lead early.\n\nPractical decision: end the turn now with a concise status, and explicitly tell the user: if t3/t4/t5 haven't started by the time they look, the scheduler has stalled again and I'll take the rebuild path (or they can say the word).\n\nActually, better: let me ALSO try the cheap provocation before ending the turn — reassign t3/t4/t5 (same owners). It didn't wake members last time, but it's harmless and revokes nothing important (attempt 0 → attempt 1 for same owner). Hmm, it also risks... nothing. But is it useful? If dispatch happens at turn end, no need. If dispatch is broken, reassign won't help (proven). So skip it — avoid unnecessary churn.\n\nHmm, one more consideration: maybe dispatch ALSO happens when a *new message* is delivered... no, proven not.\n\nDecision: end turn with a short status. Include: what's done (t1/t2 complete, contract now 248+ lines with §L/§M), what's pending dispatch (t3/t4/t5 ready), and the escalation plan. Keep it SHORT so the scheduler gets its window.\n\nLet me not run more status calls; write the message now."},{"type":"text","text":"`t1` 与 `t2` 都已完成，`t3/t4/t5` 的依赖已满足——但它们停在 attempt 0、全员 idle，且 90 秒内无任何文件写入。这与我观察到的规律一致：**成员回合只在队长回合之间被调度**，所以我现在结束本轮，把窗口让给调度器。\n\n## 本轮成果（这一轮的实际产出都在\"纠偏\"上）\n\n**t1（契约校验）verdict=pass**，并给出全绿基线：`bun test packages` 215 通过 / 0 失败、typecheck exit 0、`verify-vendor` PASS、`test:qa` 全过，且该成员**未改动任何文件**（HEAD 与 33 项未提交条目前后一致）。\n\n**t2（遍历档案）完成**，独立在**两个调用点**复现了 deny 缺陷（`mpd_role_spawn{librarian}` 与 `mpd_workmate_spawn{oracle-1}`），抓到完整 104 项活注册表——契约里的 7 名单**逐个可注册**，两个死名字确实都不存在。\n\n## 我在这一轮做的裁决（全部写入契约，成员随时可读）\n\n- **A2 两个 deny 列表对齐**（我拍板）：workmate 侧补齐到与 roles 侧相同的 7 项，闭合\"只读 workmate 可经 bash 写文件\"这个被缺陷掩盖的洞，并加**两数组相等的守卫测试**消除漂移。\n- **§M 五项缺口裁决**：只读实例**允许**被改名/删除（属库管理，非 workmate 自改）；同名改名 → `400 invalid-name`；无 `meta.json` 的孤儿目录 → `404 unknown` 零副作用；**带旧键的 reflect 不解析 `renamedFrom`**（绝不复活目录）；冲突判定改用 `lstat` 并把**任何**命中（含\"改名到已存在的空目录会静默成功\"、悬空软链）统一映射为 `409 collision`。\n- **M6**：门禁固定读 `<cwd>/.mpd/team`（配置查询返回 null，不加查找）；并提醒 QA 是 `HOME=<sandbox>` 但 `cwd=repo`，所以沙箱用例同样要避开角色名。\n- **M7**：禁止改动镜像副本（`.qa-reloc/**`、`dist/mpd-package/**`、已跟踪的 `evidence/scan/