evidence/agent-teams/sidebar-migration/final-2026-09-10T03-04-41Z/install-dry-run.log:219:              role: RTL implementation (Verilog/SV lane)
evidence/agent-teams/sidebar-migration/final-2026-09-10T03-04-41Z/install-dry-run.log:223:              executionPrompt: "RTL code engineer (Verilog/SystemVerilog). Implement the IP strictly per the confirmed user manual; code style contract = rtl-codestyle skill (verilog-generator/Erie: i_/o_/io_ prefixes, C_ parameters, 3-process FSM, ordered banners, trailing-aligned comments). Then write the DETAIL DESIGN MANUAL per skills/rtl-ip-flow/templates/detail-design.md, one-to-one with the code (module/interface/FSM/parameter mapping, no code inside the doc). Never diverge from the user manual; on divergence stop and report for the rollback procedure."
evidence/agent-teams/sidebar-migration/final-2026-09-10T03-04-41Z/install-dry-run.log:224:            - name: RTL Code Engineer — SpinalHDL
evidence/agent-teams/sidebar-migration/final-2026-09-10T03-04-41Z/install-dry-run.log:225:              role: RTL implementation (SpinalHDL/Chisel lane)
evidence/agent-teams/sidebar-migration/final-2026-09-10T03-04-41Z/install-dry-run.log:229:              executionPrompt: "RTL code engineer (SpinalHDL/Chisel). Implement the IP strictly per the confirmed user manual, following the project's existing SpinalHDL conventions (RDC-pattern rules: no hardware-computed parameter defaults, no precision-losing resize, split register fields with named fieldAt, doc-sync after every change, no dangling signals). Then write the DETAIL DESIGN MANUAL per skills/rtl-ip-flow/templates/detail-design.md, one-to-one with the code. Never diverge from the user manual; on divergence stop and report."
evidence/agent-teams/sidebar-migration/final-2026-09-10T03-04-41Z/install-dry-run.log:230:            - name: Verification Engineer
evidence/agent-teams/sidebar-migration/final-2026-09-10T03-04-41Z/install-dry-run.log:231:              role: verification code + plan + dual-track verification
evidence/agent-teams/sidebar-migration/final-2026-09-10T03-04-41Z/install-dry-run.log:235:              executionPrompt: "Verification engineer. In stage 3 (parallel with code): derive test points from the user manual, write the verification code and the verification plan per skills/rtl-ip-flow/templates/verification-plan.md; also run the manual-vs-code consistency check and report findings. In stage 4: dual-track verification — functional track per the user manual (cocotb lane or UVM lane per backend; all cases PASS), coverage track per the detail design (verilator coverage merge/report, or VCS urg + fsdbreport; plan targets met or justified). Report evidence paths; no silent target relaxing."
evidence/agent-teams/sidebar-migration/final-2026-09-10T03-04-41Z/install-dry-run.log:241:              executionPrompt: "RTL-IP gate reviewer. Produce correctness/risk findings with evidence (file:line); verify manual-vs-code consistency and verification-plan coverage claims; recommend fixes but do not apply them. Review only; never edit files."
evidence/agent-teams/sidebar-migration/final-2026-09-10T03-04-41Z/install-dry-run.log:247:              executionPrompt: "Read-only plan reviewer for the RTL-IP flow. Verify the staged plan follows the four-gate flow (halts at manual gates, rollback procedure on divergence) and that documents map to their templates; reject only true blockers; never edit files."
