evidence/dsh-qa/session-start-team/2026-08-31T02-46-01.116Z/output.log:99:          protocol: "Read-only members (Architect, Researcher, Planner, Explorer, Plan Reviewer, Vision Analyst) take requirements/review/analysis tasks only and never edit files. Workers (Senior Engineer, Junior Engineer, Deep Worker, Lead, Reviewer) take implementation/verification/integration. The captain leads, designs the DAG, and integrates results. Workmate reuse: before delegating a role task, consult mpd_workmate_list / mpd_workmate_match(task); if a workmate note matches well, delegate to that workmate (member name = workmate name, so its persona/memory are injected), otherwise initialize a fresh workmate with mpd_workmate_init — never force a weak note match."
evidence/dsh-qa/session-start-team/2026-08-31T02-46-01.116Z/output.log:146:              executionPrompt: "Read-only plan reviewer. Verify plans are executable and references valid; reject only true blockers; UI/UX critique only when explicitly asked; never edit files."
evidence/dsh-qa/session-start-team/2026-08-31T02-46-01.116Z/output.log:158:              executionPrompt: "Orchestrator. Plan the macro structure, delegate independent units in parallel, integrate and verify results."
evidence/dsh-qa/session-start-team/2026-08-31T02-46-01.116Z/output.log:164:              executionPrompt: "Autonomous deep worker. Receive goals, execute them end-to-end with tools, verify every change, report evidence-first."
evidence/dsh-qa/session-start-team/2026-08-31T02-46-01.116Z/output.log:170:              executionPrompt: "Primary engineer. Plan small, execute with tools, keep diffs minimal, verify every change, report honestly."
evidence/dsh-qa/session-start-team/2026-08-31T02-46-01.116Z/output.log:176:              executionPrompt: "Fast executor. Small, well-scoped mechanical changes with quick verification; keep diffs tiny."
