evidence/fix/verif-tool-lossless/20260911T030646Z/install-profile.log:202:          description: "RTL IP design workflow aligned to the four-swimlane product flow (product market / system design / digital design / digital verification) with milestone gates 规格设计 IP01 → 代码设计 IP05 → 设计验证 IP08 → IP 发布 IP10 and diamond reviews: requirements (需求说明书/应用场景/可行性报告/需求追踪表 → 需求评审) → spec design (内部用户手册 + DFMEA 初版 + 验证计划/验证方案 → 规格评审/验证评审) → code design (RTL + 详细设计 + 环境/用例开发 + 验证调试 → 设计评审/验证评审; spec-diff rollback) → verification and release (缺陷解决/回归验证 + 设计发布(内/外部用户手册)/发布评审 + 缺陷分析(缺陷报告/Buglist)/缺陷评审). Opening questions: HDL language (Verilog/SV vs SpinalHDL/Chisel) and verification backend (open-source / VCS / auto-adapt)."
evidence/fix/verif-tool-lossless/20260911T030646Z/install-profile.log:203:          protocol: "RTL-IP SWIMLANE FLOW (skills/rtl-ip-flow is the binding execution contract). Gate semantics: EVERY diamond is passed by a Reviewer check (red and green alike — Reviewer/Plan Reviewer findings must be clear before any review completes); the color only adds the extra step — 🔴 GATE = Reviewer findings first, then a manual user halt (需求评审/规格评审/发布评审/缺陷评审); 🟢 = reviewer-only, no user halt (设计评审/验证评审). STAGE 0: ask the user (one batch): HDL language → delegate code to 'RTL Code Engineer — Verilog/SV' (rtl-codestyle) or 'RTL Code Engineer — SpinalHDL'; verification backend → open-source (cocotb + verilator coverage), VCS (UVM + urg/fsdbreport), or auto-adapt (probe mpd_verif_backends). STAGE 1 需求阶段: 需求制定 (product market — user + captain): capture the initial request, 需求说明书 and 应用场景; 需求分析 (system design — Requirement Analyst, read-only by discipline): Socratic-question the user until unambiguous, output the 可行性报告 and 需求追踪表 and settle templates/req-spec.md; 🔴 GATE 需求评审 — Reviewer findings first, then user confirmation of request, scenarios and trace; nothing proceeds without it. STAGE 2 规格设计 IP01: 数字设计 (Spec Designer): write the 内部用户手册 strictly per templates/user-manual.md (product-manual granularity; internal version authoritative) + DFMEA 初版 per templates/dfmea.md; 数字验证 (Verification Engineer, verification content FRONT-LOADED into this stage): drive Socratic verification questions at the Spec Designer until the design is verifiable (every feature point, interface signal, register field, boundary/exception, testability, coverage target explicit), write the conclusions back into the spec documents (verification points/testability annotated in the internal user manual + the verification plan), then produce 验证计划 + 验证方案 per templates/verification-plan.md; 🔴 GATE 规格评审 — Reviewer/Plan Reviewer check internal manual + DFMEA + verification plan/scheme first, then the user reviews; no code before it passes; revision loop repeats the spec/manual, never the code; 🟢 验证评审 (reviewer-only, automatic): Plan Reviewer/Reviewer check the verification plan against the manual. STAGE 3 代码设计 IP05: 数字设计 (RTL Code Engineer of the chosen lane): implement per the confirmed manual under the style contract; write the 详细设计 per templates/detail-design.md one-to-one with the code (no code inside the doc); 数字验证 parallel: 环境开发 → 用例开发 → 验证调试 (验证报告 + 验证手册 per templates/validation-report.md / validation-manual.md). Consistency rule: no non-essential difference between detail manual/code and the internal user manual — on real divergence, stash the stage-3 files (git stash / copy aside), re-run stage 2 to correct the manual, get it confirmed, return and redo stage 3; never patch around the divergence. 🟢 设计评审 + 🟢 验证评审 (reviewer-only, no user halt): Reviewer/Plan Reviewer check code + detail manual + validation debug results; the verification engineer reports the manual-vs-code consistency check first. STAGE 4 设计验证 IP08 → IP 发布 IP10: 缺陷解决 (design) ↔ 验证调试/回归 (verification): fix defects, rerun affected cases then full 回归验证 dual-track — track 1 functional per the internal manual (cocotb or UVM lane per backend, all cases PASS), track 2 coverage per the detail design (verilator merge/report or VCS urg + fsdbreport, targets met or justified). 设计发布: 内部 + 外部用户手册 (external = pure subset) per templates/user-manual.md → 🔴 GATE 发布评审 (Reviewer findings first, then user halt). 缺陷分析: 缺陷报告 + Buglist per templates/defect-report.md → 🔴 GATE 缺陷评审 (Reviewer findings first, then user halt; closure before IP10). IP10 = all reviews green + dual-track evidence committed."
