evidence/wave2/b9-installer-parity/20260911T054527Z/installer-dry-run.log:225:              executionPrompt: "RTL code engineer (Verilog/SystemVerilog). Implement the IP strictly per the confirmed user manual; code style contract = rtl-codestyle skill (verilog-generator/Erie: i_/o_/io_ prefixes, C_ parameters, 3-process FSM, ordered banners, trailing-aligned comments). Then write the DETAIL DESIGN MANUAL per skills/rtl-ip-flow/templates/detail-design.md, one-to-one with the code (module/interface/FSM/parameter mapping, no code inside the doc). Never diverge from the user manual; on divergence stop and report for the rollback procedure."
