evidence/wave2/t10-review/20260911T063000Z/t10-REVIEW.md:82:No `*.bak` / `*.orig` / `.r1pre.bak` / marker files anywhere in the tree; no empty evidence directories; t2's guard lives in `scripts/` (no `skills/**` overlap). The one class worth naming: QA scratch directories at the repo root (`.qa-web-client`, `.qa-reloc`, `.qa-tmp`, `.npm-cache`, `.tmp-cache`, `.venv-rtl`, `.git-home`, `.codegraph`, `.mpd-dsh`) — all gitignored (checked individually) and sanctioned QA state; `.dsh/` is a pre-existing (2026-08-31) stray home, not created by this wave. I removed my own scratch copies (`t9-verification/…/scratch`, `t10-review/…/guard-{copy,fullstrip,repro}`) and left only their result/log artifacts as evidence.
