e README pairs) plus the two cross-referenced findings you already reported: the `devPatch()` `baseUrl + \"/node_modules/\"` operand defect in `preset-register.mjs`, and the bundle-lifecycle sandbox's `init status=fail binary=<resolved>` observation. Do not start new work — t12 (R1-F1) is separately queued for you and I will leave it in place.",
