l, and if it cannot be tested here, say so rather than implying it was\",\"status\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"Both layouts are actually TESTED, not inferred. packed-gate.result.json (7/7): `npm pack` of dist/mpd-package produces a tarball (which ships both launchers + the shared resolver), the tarball is installed into a sandbox profile with npm, and from the INSTALLED launcher the resolver reports ast-grep -> <profile>/node_modules/@ast-grep/cli/ast-grep source=require and codegraph -> <profile>/node_modules/@colbymchenry/codegraph/npm-shim.js source=require; real MCP calls answer and the env-pin negative control still yields BINARY_NOT_FOUND. Checkout layout: mcp-gate.result.json + the boot A plugin line resolve through <bundle>/.toolchain. (A `file:<dir>` dependency is symlinked and does NOT install optionalDependencies — same as pnpm link: — which is why the tarball form is used; documented in the gate script.)\"},{\"criterion\":\"The change is proven by a MOUNTING boot (isolated DSH_HOME + sandbox HOME) with 0 apply-crash signatures, plus the preset-conformance case still reporting ok:true with its negative control — a patch/preset row change cannot be validated by `--dump-config` alone\",\"status\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"preset-conformance PASS (exit 0): ok=true, 30 rows checked, parity {reference:31, ours:31, missing:[], extra:[]}, a real session created over the API in an isolated home, bootLog signatures [], negativeControl ok (agent-preset/invalid). bundle-lifecycle PASS (exit 0): official `dsh plugin --profile w add <repo>` link: install composes the bundle row, the real web boot serves the corpus/preset/adapter seams, uninstall leaves no residue. b8-boot.mjs 4/4: the dev-flavor patch applies with 0 crash signatures in an isolated DSH_HOME + sandbox HOME (mpd-astgrep/lsp/codegraph rows applied, no MCP child spawn failure), with the HEAD pre-change patch booting identically as a control. Evidence copied to evidence/wave2/b8-binary-resolution/mount-gates/; no --dump-config result is cited as load evidence.\"},{\"criterion\":\"`node scripts/verify-vendor.mjs` still exits 0 and no file under skills/** was modified by this task\",\"status\":\"passed\",\"evidence\":\"verify-vendor exit 0 ([verify-vendor] PASS, every asset OK — the adopted ast-grep/codegraph dists were NOT touched). No skills/** path appears in this task's changedPaths; skills/ carries 10 modifications in the working tree but they belong to t7 (QA workspace isolation), not to this task — the B8 masking fix in skills/dsh-qa/scripts/mcp-call.mjs:36-39 is cross-referenced only.\"}]\n  commandsRun: [{\"command\":\"node skills/dsh-qa/scripts/preset-conformance.mjs\",\"status\":\"passed\",\"exitCode\":0,\"evidence\":\"PASS exit 0: ok=true, 30 rows checked, parity 31/31, real session created (sessionHeader ok, agentPreset mpd), bootLog signatures [] , negative control ok. Evidence: evidence/wave2/b8-binary-resolution/mount-gates/preset-conformance.result.json (and evidence/dsh-qa/preset-conformance/2026-09-11T05-59-13.776Z/).\"},{\"command\":\"bun skills/dsh-qa/scripts/bundle-lifecycle.mjs\",\"status\":\"passed\",\"exitCode\":0,\"evidence\":\"PASS exit 0: one-command `dsh plugin --profile w add <repo>` install (link:/root/dshProj/my-power-dsh), real web boot with adapter seams + served corpus/preset, no home copy, layer durability, uninstall with no residue. Embedded boot.log carries `[mpd-codegraph] init status=fail binary=<...>/.toolchain/node_modules/.bin/codegraph` (binary resolved; pre-fix was no-binary). Evidence: mount-gates/bundle-lifecycle.result.json + .boot.log.\"},{\"command\":\"node evidence/wave2/b8-binary-resolution/b8-mcp-gate.mjs  && node evidence/wave2/b8-binary-resolution/b8-packed-gate.mjs  (a real MCP tool call for ast_grep and codegraph)\",\"status\":\"passed\",\"exitCode\":0,\"evidence\":\"b8-mcp-gate 5/5 exit 0 (checkout layout): real ast_grep search returns totalMatches:1; negative control BINARY_NOT_FOUND; codegraph tools/list + real 