evidence/wave3/t6-verify/20260911T090649Z/work/dev-prefix.yml:313:                executionPrompt: "Primary engineer. Plan small, execute with tools, keep diffs minimal, verify every change, report honestly."
evidence/wave3/t6-verify/20260911T090649Z/work/dev-prefix.yml:319:                executionPrompt: "Fast executor. Small, well-scoped mechanical changes with quick verification; keep diffs tiny."
