evidence/workmate/rename-delete-integration/2026-09-10T14-40-00Z/team-task-records.json:191:      "description": "The requirements work was already done by the previous team; its contract survived as .mpd/plans/workmate-rename-delete-contract.md (written by the captain from the Planner's completed t1 output plus the captain's live-measured corrections). Your job is an independent, adversarial VALIDATION of that file against reality — not a rewrite, and not a fresh planning exercise.\n\nRead the contract file first, then verify its claims against the actual code and, where a claim is about runtime behaviour, against a live signal rather than a config file. Pay special attention to:\n- Section G: the previous team's finding was that only apply_patch was dead. The captain measured live (twice, via mpd_role_spawn) that the harness reports BOTH str_replace_editor and apply_patch as unknown and that the live registry contains write/edit/mpd_hashline_edit. Confirm or refute this with your own live or source-anchored evidence, and state clearly which list the implementers must ship.\n- Section E: whether the in-use gate is genuinely implementable with no cross-plugin service, including the exact .mpd/team/<teamId>/team.json shape a read-only scan must parse, and whether fail-open is the right behaviour when the scan errors.\n- Section D: whether every status code / reason value in the table can actually be produced by the current route-registration pattern, and whether the GUI can branch on it without ambiguity.\n- Section H: whether the matrix covers all four invariants, and whether any row's outcome is undefined.\n\nYou are a read-only member: the deliverable is your task output text (corrections and confirmations), not a file edit. A precise, evidence-cited correction list is worth more than agreement — if the contract is right, say so and show the evidence; if it is wrong anywhere, name the line and the fix.",
evidence/workmate/rename-delete-integration/2026-09-10T14-40-00Z/team-task-records.json:201:        "The preserved contract at .mpd/plans/workmate-rename-delete-contract.md is verified line-by-line against the real sources (packages/mpd-workmate-plugin/src/index.ts, packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/src/web-client.js, packages/mpd-agent-teams-plugin/lib/members.js, the existing tests, the bundle patch and the mpd preset), with any claim that no longer holds reported as a correction.",
