evidence/workmate/rename-delete-integration/2026-09-10T14-40-00Z/team-task-records.json:545:      "output": "t4 DONE — the Workmates tab now carries rename + delete with the full §D reason matrix, natural zh/en wording, no stale selection, and a rebuilt committed client artifact.\n\nWHAT SHIPPED\n1. request() (web-client.js) no longer discards the wire detail: it throws an error carrying `status`, `body`, `reason` and `blocking[]`. New describeFailure(error, t) branches on reason → 400 invalid-name (server text, incl. §M2 same-key rename, else dictionary), 400 confirm-required, 404 unknown, 409 collision, 409 in-use with the blocking list interpolated (asserted: `{blocking}` can never leak raw). Checkpoint 1 satisfied.\n2. Explicit two-step delete (D1): the first click only opens the confirmation (zero POSTs asserted); the archive step explains archive-first + restorability with Archive/Cancel; purge is a further step stating it is permanent and requiring `confirm === <name>` typed (control `disabled` + `aria-disabled` until exact; a wrong name provably fires no request). Toasts: renamed / archived / purged.\n3. No stale selection (§H): a successful rename reselects the NEW key and the LAST GET is /get?name=<new>; delete leaves the detail pane and never re-reads the dead key; a GET answering reason \"unknown\" clears the selection (no 404 loop). Rename input is PRE-FILLED with the current key (task acceptance item 1).\n4. zh/en parity (§L A7): 27 new mutate.* keys (incl. 6 reason keys) in both dictionaries, registered and exported; tests assert identical key sets, non-empty strings, and genuinely different wording. Chinese reads naturally (i18n-probe.txt): \"默认先归档：实例移入 ~/.mpd/workmate/.archive/，之后仍可恢复。\" / \"该名称已被占用，请换一个名称。\" / \"该 workmate 正在被使用，已拒绝操作；请先结束或归档这些团队： {blocking}\".\n5. §K honored: the tab-STRIP label stays hardcoded English \"Workmates\" (pinned by a test as a deliberate deferral); the page BODY is fully zh/en.\n6. Harness grown (M8): fetchImpl takes a per-request canned-response table keyed by `METHOD path` (a 409 in-use body is now expressible), ctx.locale.register captures the {zh,en} dictionaries, createElement preserves `key`, the locale case is order-independent, and hooks.act() renders a state change made outside the render loop plus an awaited flush.\n7. Artifact (M7): client.js rebuilt in the same change (257590 bytes, idempotent re-run, sha256 6135f5cc3d80…) and its markers verified in the COMMITTED bytes; the stale mirrors (.qa-reloc/**, dist/mpd-package/**, evidence/scan/**) were NOT edited. NOTE for t10/t11: dist/mpd-package/packages/mpd-bundle-plugin/client.js is now a stale mirror dated 18:21 — refreshing it is the release step `node scripts/pack-mpd.mjs`, which t4 must not run.\n\nGATES (all green; full log on disk)\nbun test packages 287 pass/0 fail (bundle plugin 52 pass; sidebar-tab suite 22 pass, was 9); bun run typecheck clean; bun run test:qa all self-tests pass; verify-vendor PASS; isolated DSH_HOME+HOME sweep: bundle install exit 0 and `dsh --profile w --dump-config` composes mpd-web-compat (@mpd-dsh/mpd) + mpd-workmate (dist/index.js), with the real ~/.mpd/workmate byte-identical before/after. Evidence: evidence/workmate/rename-delete-gui/2026-09-10T12-50-43.482Z/{gate-sweep.sh, result.json all_passed:true, output.log, dump-config.txt/.err, i18n-probe.txt}.\n\nBASELINE items (not my delta, not t4-owned): a fresh `w` profile has no `agent-presets` row, so its boot log carries the pre-existing `patch: entry \"agent-presets\" not found` (recorded in the evidence; my boot assertions deliberately do not depend on it) — that row/preset default belongs to t10/t11. HEAD stays f697088; porcelain 66 entries before and after; my delta is exactly the four code files listed in changedPaths plus that new evidence directory.",
evidence/workmate/rename-delete-integration/2026-09-10T14-40-00Z/team-task-records.json:587:          "evidence": "Build succeeds and is idempotent (257590 bytes; re-run byte-identical, sha256 6135f5cc3d80…). Markers verified in the committed bytes: SIDEBAR_TAB_ID=\"mpd-workmate\", RENAME_URL/DELETE_URL route constants, mutate.purgeConfirm, mutate.reason.inUse, describeFailure — all present (i18n-probe.txt last line: true,true,true,true,true,true). bun test packages/mpd-bundle-plugin: 52 pass / 0 fail (sidebar-tab suite 22 pass, was 9)."
