evidence/workmate/rename-delete-integration/2026-09-10T14-40-00Z/team-task-records.json:1355:      "description": "Sync every documentation and QA-assertion surface with what actually shipped, in both languages, in one coherent pass. Start from the t6 verification evidence and the contract at .mpd/plans/workmate-rename-delete-contract.md so the docs describe verified behaviour rather than intentions.\n\nBinding repo rules: agent-facing content (AGENTS.md, code comments, QA scripts) is English-only; every human-facing doc ships BOTH English and 简体中文 *.zh-CN.md, kept in sync in the same change, each with the language switch link directly under its title; process artifacts (docs/plan-*.md, docs/decisions.md, prior-phase reports) and internal QA/golden reference docs are exempt from the bilingual rule. Update only docs that genuinely enumerate workmate capability — do not mass-rewrite docs that merely mention the word.\n\nIf the t2 dossier flagged a doc-vs-code contradiction touching the workmate surface, fix it here.\n\nScope boundary: do not change implementation code (t3/t4/t5 own it) and do not touch the read-only-spawn QA case or its SKILL.md row (t5 owns them) — append your rows without disturbing theirs.",
