evidence/workmate/rename-delete-integration/2026-09-10T14-40-00Z/team-task-records.json:1823:      "objective": "Independently verify that the F1 repair's new assertion is real and falsifiable: the shipped case must prove the spawned read-only child is RESTRICTED (not merely that the deny list was sent), and the re-injection lane must show the assertion FAILING, so the guard cannot look green while the restriction is absent.",
evidence/workmate/rename-delete-integration/2026-09-10T14-40-00Z/team-task-records.json:1835:        "The new F1 assertion is verified from the REVIEWER's side, not the author's: re-run the instrumented reviewer copy (independently of the shipped case) and confirm the assertion PASSES on the shipped seven-name list and FAILS in the re-injection lane.",
