evidence/workmate/rename-delete-integration/2026-09-10T14-40-00Z/team-task-records.json:2092:        "The `skills` treeSha is recomputed with the gate's OWN `readBytes`/`listFiles` helpers — never hand-derived (the gate hashes under `f.slice(dir.length + 1)` with the ABSOLUTE skills path, and two hand-derived digests were already rejected) and never a value pasted from a message as a constant: verify the recomputed value actually matches the tree before writing it.",
