skills/data-scientist/references/uv-setup.md:12:Both scripts: detect OS + architecture → install uv to the latest release when missing → upgrade it when present (`uv self update`) → make it resolvable for the current shell → verify with `uv --version`. They are idempotent — safe to re-run any time.
